window.CGL_DATA=window.CGL_DATA||{};window.CGL_DATA["CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3"]={"id":"CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3","title":"CGL 08 OCT 2026 SHIFT 3","order":["REASONING","GK","MATH","ENGLISH"],"marking":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"qualifying":[],"sections":{"REASONING":{"seconds":900,"questions":[{"no":1,"local_id":"50001","quid":"Q1000074781","section":"REASONING","topic":"Word Analogy","question":{"en":"In the following question, select the related word from the given alternatives.<br><b>Brain: Cognitive process::Kidney:?</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित प्रश्न में, दिए गए विकल्पों में से संबंधित शब्द का चयन कीजिए।<br><b>मस्तिष्क: संज्ञानात्मक प्रक्रिया::गुर्दा:?</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Digestive Process","hi":"पाचन प्रक्रिया"},"2":{"en":"Filtration Process","hi":"निस्यंदन प्रक्रिया"},"3":{"en":"Breathing Process","hi":"श्वसन प्रक्रिया"},"4":{"en":"Producing Bile","hi":"पित्त बनाना"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"The brain carries out cognitive processes.<br>The kidney carries out filtration of blood.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): Filtration Process.</b>","hi":"मस्तिष्क संज्ञानात्मक प्रक्रियाएँ करता है।<br>गुर्दा रक्त का निस्यंदन करता है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): निस्यंदन प्रक्रिया है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":2,"local_id":"50002","quid":"Q1000074782","section":"REASONING","topic":"Mathematical Operations","question":{"en":"If # = +, @ = ×, % = −, then <b>(5 # 2) @ 3 % 4 = ?</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यदि # = +, @ = ×, % = − है, तो <b>(5 # 2) @ 3 % 4 = ?</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"20"},"2":{"en":"17"},"3":{"en":"18"},"4":{"en":"21"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"(5 + 2) × 3 − 4<br>= 21 − 4 = 17<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 17.</b>","hi":"(5 + 2) × 3 − 4<br>= 21 − 4 = 17<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 17 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":3,"local_id":"50003","quid":"Q1000074783","section":"REASONING","topic":"Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"<b>If numbers starting with 732 are Omega numbers,</b> how many Omega numbers are there in the below series?<br><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732819</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732100</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">745668</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732547</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732890</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">712345</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732123</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732456</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">712732</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732001</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732999</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732333</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">822732</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732654</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732321</td></tr></table> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>यदि 732 से शुरू होने वाली संख्याएँ ओमेगा संख्याएँ हैं,</b> तो नीचे दी गई श्रृंखला में कितनी ओमेगा संख्याएँ हैं?<br><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732819</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732100</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">745668</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732547</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732890</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">712345</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732123</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732456</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">712732</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732001</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732999</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732333</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">822732</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732654</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">732321</td></tr></table> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"10"},"2":{"en":"11"},"3":{"en":"12"},"4":{"en":"13"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Row 1: 732819, 732100, 732547, 732890 → 4<br>Row 2: 732123, 732456, 732001 → 3<br>Row 3: 732999, 732333, 732654, 732321 → 4<br>Total = 11<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 11.</b>","hi":"पंक्ति 1: 732819, 732100, 732547, 732890 → 4<br>पंक्ति 2: 732123, 732456, 732001 → 3<br>पंक्ति 3: 732999, 732333, 732654, 732321 → 4<br>कुल = 11<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 11 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":4,"local_id":"50004","quid":"Q1000074784","section":"REASONING","topic":"Statement & Conclusion","question":{"en":"<b>Statement:</b> \"Technological literacy is becoming as fundamental as reading and writing in the 21st century.\"<br><b>conclusions:</b><br>I. Those without technological literacy may be disadvantaged.<br>II. Traditional literacy skills are becoming irrelevant. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>कथन:</b> \"21वीं सदी में तकनीकी साक्षरता पढ़ने और लिखने जितनी ही मूलभूत होती जा रही है।\"<br><b>निष्कर्ष:</b><br>I. तकनीकी साक्षरता से रहित लोग नुकसान में रह सकते हैं।<br>II. पारंपरिक साक्षरता कौशल अप्रासंगिक होते जा रहे हैं। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Only I follows","hi":"केवल I अनुसरण करता है"},"2":{"en":"Only II follows","hi":"केवल II अनुसरण करता है"},"3":{"en":"Both follow","hi":"दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं"},"4":{"en":"Neither follows","hi":"कोई अनुसरण नहीं करता"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"If tech literacy is as basic as reading and writing, people without it may fall behind: I ✔<br>\"As fundamental as\" keeps reading and writing important: II ✗<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): Only I follows.</b>","hi":"यदि तकनीकी साक्षरता पढ़ने-लिखने जितनी मूलभूत है, तो इसके बिना लोग पीछे रह सकते हैं: I ✔<br>\"उतनी ही मूलभूत\" का अर्थ है पढ़ना-लिखना भी महत्वपूर्ण है: II ✗<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): केवल I अनुसरण करता है है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":5,"local_id":"50005","quid":"Q1000074785","section":"REASONING","topic":"Situational Judgement","question":{"en":"<b>Read the following scenario carefully and choose the most appropriate transportation option that fulfills all the given criteria.</b><br>Ankit is planning a weekend trip with friends. They want a place where they can enjoy nature, do light trekking, and stay within a limited budget. Which option should he choose? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>निम्नलिखित परिदृश्य को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़िए और सबसे उपयुक्त विकल्प चुनिए जो सभी दी गई शर्तों को पूरा करता हो।</b><br>अंकित दोस्तों के साथ सप्ताहांत यात्रा की योजना बना रहा है। वे ऐसी जगह चाहते हैं जहाँ प्रकृति का आनंद ले सकें, हल्की ट्रेकिंग कर सकें और सीमित बजट में रह सकें। उसे कौन-सा विकल्प चुनना चाहिए? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"A luxury beach resort with private pools and fine dining.","hi":"निजी पूल और उत्तम भोजन वाला एक लक्ज़री बीच रिसॉर्ट।"},"2":{"en":"A mountain lodge offering trekking trails, group cabins, and campfires.","hi":"ट्रेकिंग मार्ग, समूह केबिन और अलाव वाला एक पहाड़ी लॉज।"},"3":{"en":"A theme park with premium ticket packages and food courts.","hi":"प्रीमियम टिकट पैकेज और फूड कोर्ट वाला एक थीम पार्क।"},"4":{"en":"A city hotel near a shopping mall with weekend sales.","hi":"सप्ताहांत सेल वाले शॉपिंग मॉल के पास एक शहरी होटल।"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Needs: nature + light trekking + low budget.<br>Only the mountain lodge gives trekking and nature, and group cabins keep the cost low.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): A mountain lodge offering trekking trails, group cabins, and campfires.</b>","hi":"आवश्यकताएँ: प्रकृति + हल्की ट्रेकिंग + कम बजट।<br>केवल पहाड़ी लॉज में ट्रेकिंग और प्रकृति है, और समूह केबिन से खर्च कम रहता है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): ट्रेकिंग मार्ग, समूह केबिन और अलाव वाला एक पहाड़ी लॉज। है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":6,"local_id":"50006","quid":"Q1000074786","section":"REASONING","topic":"Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"Simplify: 2/3 + 3/4 - 5/6 [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"सरल कीजिए: 2/3 + 3/4 - 5/6 [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"5/9"},"2":{"en":"7/12"},"3":{"en":"3/7"},"4":{"en":"11/13"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"LCM = 12: \\(\\frac{8 + 9 - 10}{12}\\)<br>= \\(\\frac{7}{12}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 7/12.</b>","hi":"LCM = 12: \\(\\frac{8 + 9 - 10}{12}\\)<br>= \\(\\frac{7}{12}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 7/12 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":7,"local_id":"50007","quid":"Q1000074787","section":"REASONING","topic":"Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"In a row of 100 seats, every 4th seat is marked with a sticker, and every 6th seat has a cushion.<br>How many seats have both a sticker and a cushion? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"100 सीटों की एक पंक्ति में, हर चौथी सीट पर स्टिकर लगा है और हर छठी सीट पर गद्दी है।<br>कितनी सीटों पर स्टिकर और गद्दी दोनों हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"8"},"2":{"en":"10"},"3":{"en":"12"},"4":{"en":"15"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Both → multiples of LCM(4, 6) = 12<br>Multiples of 12 up to 100 = 12, 24, …, 96 → 8 seats<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 8.</b>","hi":"दोनों → LCM(4, 6) = 12 के गुणज<br>100 तक 12 के गुणज = 12, 24, …, 96 → 8 सीटें<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): 8 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":8,"local_id":"50008","quid":"Q1000074788","section":"REASONING","topic":"Dictionary / Alphabetical Order","question":{"en":"Identify the word that comes last in a dictionary. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"उस शब्द की पहचान कीजिए जो शब्दकोश में सबसे अंत में आता है। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Accept"},"2":{"en":"Achieve"},"3":{"en":"Amazing"},"4":{"en":"Acknowledge"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Order: Accept, Achieve, Acknowledge, Amazing<br>Second letter m comes after c → Amazing is last.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Amazing.</b>","hi":"क्रम: Accept, Achieve, Acknowledge, Amazing<br>दूसरा अक्षर m, c के बाद आता है → Amazing अंतिम है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): Amazing है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":9,"local_id":"50009","quid":"Q1000074789","section":"REASONING","topic":"Syllogism","question":{"en":"Here some problem or solution of the problem is given in the statement you have to choose the appropriate logical deduction for given statement.<br>All fish can swim. Some animals that can swim are not fish. Which conclusion follows? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यहाँ कथन में कोई समस्या या उसका समाधान दिया गया है, आपको दिए गए कथन के लिए उपयुक्त तार्किक निष्कर्ष चुनना है।<br>सभी मछलियाँ तैर सकती हैं। कुछ जानवर जो तैर सकते हैं, मछली नहीं हैं। कौन-सा निष्कर्ष अनुसरण करता है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"All animals are fish","hi":"सभी जानवर मछली हैं"},"2":{"en":"No fish are animals","hi":"कोई मछली जानवर नहीं है"},"3":{"en":"Some animals that swim are not fish","hi":"कुछ तैरने वाले जानवर मछली नहीं हैं"},"4":{"en":"All swimmers are fish","hi":"सभी तैराक मछली हैं"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"The second statement directly gives: some animals that swim are not fish.<br>The other options are not supported by the statements.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Some animals that swim are not fish.</b>","hi":"दूसरा कथन सीधे बताता है: कुछ तैरने वाले जानवर मछली नहीं हैं।<br>अन्य विकल्प कथनों से समर्थित नहीं हैं।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): कुछ तैरने वाले जानवर मछली नहीं हैं है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":10,"local_id":"50010","quid":"Q1000074790","section":"REASONING","topic":"Figure Series & Figure Analogy","question":{"en":"From the choices in Image Y, select the figure that logically completes the analogy in Image X.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q10.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"छवि Y के विकल्पों में से वह आकृति चुनिए जो छवि X में सादृश्य को तार्किक रूप से पूरा करती है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q10.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"1"},"2":{"en":"2"},"3":{"en":"3"},"4":{"en":"4"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"In the first pair the three shapes in a row are placed one inside the other (first shape outermost).<br>For □○△ the same rule gives figure (3).<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 3.</b>","hi":"पहले युग्म में पंक्ति की तीन आकृतियाँ एक-दूसरे के अंदर रखी गई हैं (पहली आकृति सबसे बाहर)।<br>□○△ पर यही नियम लगाने से आकृति (3) मिलती है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 3 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q10.jpg"]}},{"no":11,"local_id":"50011","quid":"Q1000074791","section":"REASONING","topic":"Venn Diagrams","question":{"en":"Based on the Venn diagram given in the image, which letter represents men who live with their parents but are neither married nor engineers?<br>Note: In the Venn diagram, the rectangle represents \"Married men\", circle represents \"Men who live with their parents\", and the triangle represents \"Engineers\".<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q11.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"चित्र में दिए गए वेन आरेख के आधार पर, कौन-सा अक्षर उन पुरुषों को दर्शाता है जो अपने माता-पिता के साथ रहते हैं लेकिन न तो विवाहित हैं और न ही इंजीनियर?<br>नोट: वेन आरेख में आयत \"विवाहित पुरुष\", वृत्त \"माता-पिता के साथ रहने वाले पुरुष\" और त्रिभुज \"इंजीनियर\" को दर्शाता है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q11.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"G"},"2":{"en":"H"},"3":{"en":"A"},"4":{"en":"C"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Required region: inside the circle only, outside the rectangle and the triangle.<br>That region is H.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): H.</b>","hi":"आवश्यक क्षेत्र: केवल वृत्त के अंदर, आयत और त्रिभुज के बाहर।<br>वह क्षेत्र H है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): H है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q11.jpg"]}},{"no":12,"local_id":"50012","quid":"Q1000074792","section":"REASONING","topic":"Paper Folding, Cutting & Mirror/Water Images","question":{"en":"Three figures, 1, 2, and 3, in Image X demonstrate how to fold a piece of paper in a specific order. The procedure for cutting the folded paper is shown in figure 3. Choose the figure in Image Y that most closely reflects figure 3's unfolded shape.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q12.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"छवि X में तीन आकृतियाँ 1, 2 और 3 दर्शाती हैं कि कागज़ के एक टुकड़े को एक विशेष क्रम में कैसे मोड़ा गया है। मोड़े गए कागज़ को काटने की प्रक्रिया आकृति 3 में दिखाई गई है। छवि Y में से वह आकृति चुनिए जो आकृति 3 के खुले रूप को सबसे अच्छी तरह दर्शाती है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q12.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"A"},"2":{"en":"B"},"3":{"en":"C"},"4":{"en":"D"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Unfold in reverse order; each hole is mirrored across the fold lines.<br>The holes then appear as in figure (B).<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): B.</b>","hi":"उल्टे क्रम में खोलें; हर छेद मोड़ की रेखाओं के पार प्रतिबिंबित होता है।<br>तब छेद आकृति (B) की तरह दिखते हैं।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): B है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q12.jpg"]}},{"no":13,"local_id":"50013","quid":"Q1000074793","section":"REASONING","topic":"Figure Series & Figure Analogy","question":{"en":"Find the figure in Image Y that comes next in the series shown in Image X.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q13.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"छवि X में दिखाई गई श्रृंखला में आगे आने वाली आकृति छवि Y में से ज्ञात कीजिए।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q13.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"A"},"2":{"en":"B"},"3":{"en":"C"},"4":{"en":"D"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"In each step one more line moves from the left side to the right side of the pole.<br>Continuing this gives figure (B).<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): B.</b>","hi":"प्रत्येक चरण में एक और रेखा खंभे के बाईं ओर से दाईं ओर जाती है।<br>इसे जारी रखने पर आकृति (B) मिलती है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): B है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q13.jpg"]}},{"no":14,"local_id":"50014","quid":"Q1000074794","section":"REASONING","topic":"Odd One Out","question":{"en":"Select the figure that is different from the rest of the figures shown in the given image.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q14.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"दी गई छवि में दिखाई गई आकृतियों में से उस आकृति का चयन कीजिए जो बाकी से भिन्न है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q14.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"A"},"2":{"en":"B"},"3":{"en":"C"},"4":{"en":"D"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"(A), (B) and (D) are the same figure rotated.<br>(C) is its mirror image, so it is different.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): C.</b>","hi":"(A), (B) और (D) एक ही आकृति के घुमाए हुए रूप हैं।<br>(C) उसका दर्पण प्रतिबिंब है, अतः भिन्न है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): C है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q14.jpg"]}},{"no":15,"local_id":"50015","quid":"Q1000074795","section":"REASONING","topic":"Dice & Cube","question":{"en":"Select the figure in Image Y that is identical to the box made by folding the paper sheet shown in Image X.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q15.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"छवि Y में से वह आकृति चुनिए जो छवि X में दिखाए गए कागज़ को मोड़कर बनाए गए बॉक्स के समान है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q15.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"A"},"2":{"en":"B"},"3":{"en":"C"},"4":{"en":"D"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"Find opposite faces from the net (faces separated by one face in a line are opposite).<br>Only figure (D) shows three faces that can be adjacent with the correct orientation.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): D.</b>","hi":"नेट से विपरीत फलक ज्ञात करें (एक पंक्ति में एक फलक छोड़कर वाले फलक विपरीत होते हैं)।<br>केवल आकृति (D) में तीन फलक सही दिशा में आसन्न हो सकते हैं।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): D है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q15.jpg"]}},{"no":16,"local_id":"50016","quid":"Q1000074796","section":"REASONING","topic":"Mathematical Operations","question":{"en":"Some of the equations are provided below with symbols and mathematical relations you have to check which of the following combination is correct<br>If A ★ B = (A + B) × (A - B), find 6 ★ 2. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"नीचे कुछ समीकरण प्रतीकों और गणितीय संबंधों के साथ दिए गए हैं, आपको जाँचना है कि निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा संयोजन सही है<br>यदि A ★ B = (A + B) × (A - B) है, तो 6 ★ 2 ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"32"},"2":{"en":"24"},"3":{"en":"20"},"4":{"en":"36"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"6 ★ 2 = (6 + 2) × (6 − 2)<br>= 8 × 4 = 32<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 32.</b>","hi":"6 ★ 2 = (6 + 2) × (6 − 2)<br>= 8 × 4 = 32<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): 32 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":17,"local_id":"50017","quid":"Q1000074797","section":"REASONING","topic":"Mathematical Operations","question":{"en":"Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?<br>20 - 6 + 8 × 2 ÷ 4 = 30 [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"समीकरण को सही बनाने के लिए किन दो चिह्नों को आपस में बदलना चाहिए?<br>20 - 6 + 8 × 2 ÷ 4 = 30 [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"+ and ×"},"2":{"en":"- and ÷"},"3":{"en":"- and +"},"4":{"en":"× and ÷"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"Interchange × and ÷: 20 − 6 + 8 ÷ 2 × 4<br>= 20 − 6 + 16 = 30 ✔<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): × and ÷.</b>","hi":"× और ÷ को बदलने पर: 20 − 6 + 8 ÷ 2 × 4<br>= 20 − 6 + 16 = 30 ✔<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): × and ÷ है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":18,"local_id":"50018","quid":"Q1000074798","section":"REASONING","topic":"Venn Diagrams","question":{"en":"Select the Venn diagram that best illustrates the relationship between the following classes.<br>Doctor, Surgeon, Nurse [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"उस वेन आरेख का चयन कीजिए जो निम्नलिखित वर्गों के बीच संबंध को सर्वोत्तम रूप से दर्शाता है।<br>डॉक्टर, सर्जन, नर्स [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{},"2":{},"3":{},"4":{}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Every surgeon is a doctor → Surgeon circle inside Doctor circle.<br>Nurse is a separate class → separate circle.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): Figure (1).</b>","hi":"प्रत्येक सर्जन डॉक्टर है → सर्जन का वृत्त डॉक्टर के वृत्त के अंदर।<br>नर्स अलग वर्ग है → अलग वृत्त।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): आकृति (1) है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"options":{"1":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q18_opt1.jpg"],"2":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q18_opt2.jpg"],"3":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q18_opt3.jpg"],"4":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q18_opt4.jpg"]}}},{"no":19,"local_id":"50019","quid":"Q1000074799","section":"REASONING","topic":"Dice & Cube","question":{"en":"A cube is made by folding the given sheet. In the cube so formed, which of the following pairs of symbols will NOT be on the opposite faces?<br><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">#</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&amp;</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&gt;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">@</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&#36;</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td></tr></table> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"दी गई शीट को मोड़कर एक घन बनाया जाता है। इस प्रकार बने घन में, प्रतीकों का निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा युग्म विपरीत फलकों पर नहीं होगा?<br><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">#</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&amp;</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&gt;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">@</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">&#36;</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #888;padding:3px 6px\">%</td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td><td style=\"padding:3px 6px\"></td></tr></table> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"&amp; and &#36;"},"2":{"en":"&#36; and #"},"3":{"en":"@ and %"},"4":{"en":"# and &gt;"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"In a straight line of three faces, the first and third are opposite.<br>@ – %, # – &gt;, and the remaining pair &#36; – &amp; are opposite.<br>&#36; and # are adjacent, not opposite.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): &#36; and #.</b>","hi":"तीन फलकों की सीधी पंक्ति में पहला और तीसरा विपरीत होते हैं।<br>@ – %, # – &gt;, और शेष युग्म &#36; – &amp; विपरीत हैं।<br>&#36; और # आसन्न हैं, विपरीत नहीं।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): &#36; and # है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":20,"local_id":"50020","quid":"Q1000074800","section":"REASONING","topic":"Situational Judgement","question":{"en":"An exceptional employee who usually exceeds targets has missed three critical deadlines. Upon private inquiry, they reveal they are undergoing a severe personal financial crisis. How do you balance empathetic leadership with strict organisational accountability? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक असाधारण कर्मचारी, जो आमतौर पर लक्ष्यों से अधिक काम करता है, तीन महत्वपूर्ण समय-सीमाएँ चूक गया है। निजी पूछताछ पर वह बताता है कि वह गंभीर व्यक्तिगत आर्थिक संकट से गुज़र रहा है। आप सहानुभूतिपूर्ण नेतृत्व और सख्त संगठनात्मक जवाबदेही के बीच संतुलन कैसे बनाएँगे? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Maintain strict performance metrics while completely ignoring the personal crisis.","hi":"व्यक्तिगत संकट को पूरी तरह अनदेखा करते हुए सख्त प्रदर्शन मानक बनाए रखेंगे।"},"2":{"en":"Suspend all performance metrics indefinitely until the employee feels fully recovered.","hi":"कर्मचारी के पूरी तरह ठीक होने तक सभी प्रदर्शन मानक अनिश्चित काल के लिए स्थगित कर देंगे।"},"3":{"en":"Express genuine concern privately while adjusting short-term expectations collaboratively.","hi":"निजी रूप से सच्ची चिंता व्यक्त करेंगे और मिलकर अल्पकालिक अपेक्षाओं को समायोजित करेंगे।"},"4":{"en":"Transfer the employee immediately to a lower-stress department to ensure compliance.","hi":"अनुपालन सुनिश्चित करने के लिए कर्मचारी का तुरंत कम तनाव वाले विभाग में स्थानांतरण कर देंगे।"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Showing concern and adjusting short-term targets together keeps both empathy and accountability.<br>Ignoring, suspending all targets or transferring goes to one extreme.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Express genuine concern privately while adjusting short-term expectations collaboratively.</b>","hi":"चिंता दिखाना और मिलकर अल्पकालिक लक्ष्य बदलना सहानुभूति और जवाबदेही दोनों बनाए रखता है।<br>अनदेखा करना, सभी लक्ष्य रोकना या स्थानांतरण एक अति है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): निजी रूप से सच्ची चिंता व्यक्त करेंगे और मिलकर अल्पकालिक अपेक्षाओं को समायोजित करेंगे। है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":21,"local_id":"50021","quid":"Q1000074801","section":"REASONING","topic":"Situational Judgement","question":{"en":"Your department must implement a necessary new internal policy that employees are highly likely to dislike or perceive negatively. To demonstrate transparent leadership, preserve long-term team trust, and ensure a smooth operational transition, what is the best approach for a manager to take? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"आपके विभाग को एक आवश्यक नई आंतरिक नीति लागू करनी है जिसे कर्मचारी संभवतः नापसंद करेंगे या नकारात्मक रूप से देखेंगे। पारदर्शी नेतृत्व दिखाने, दीर्घकालिक टीम विश्वास बनाए रखने और सुचारु परिवर्तन सुनिश्चित करने के लिए एक प्रबंधक का सबसे अच्छा तरीका क्या है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Announce the policy abruptly without providing any context, justification, or explanation.","hi":"बिना किसी संदर्भ, औचित्य या स्पष्टीकरण के अचानक नीति की घोषणा करेंगे।"},"2":{"en":"Delay the policy's implementation indefinitely, actively ignoring your operational directive.","hi":"परिचालन निर्देश को अनदेखा करते हुए नीति के कार्यान्वयन को अनिश्चित काल तक टाल देंगे।"},"3":{"en":"Clear explain the strategic rationale behind the policy, acknowledge employee concerns openly, and invite questions.","hi":"नीति के पीछे के रणनीतिक कारण को स्पष्ट रूप से समझाएँगे, कर्मचारियों की चिंताओं को खुलकर स्वीकार करेंगे और प्रश्न आमंत्रित करेंगे।"},"4":{"en":"Blame senior management entirely for the decision to deflect personal responsibility and distance your department from the company.","hi":"व्यक्तिगत ज़िम्मेदारी से बचने और अपने विभाग को कंपनी से दूर करने के लिए निर्णय का पूरा दोष वरिष्ठ प्रबंधन पर डालेंगे।"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Explaining the reason, accepting concerns and inviting questions builds trust and a smooth transition.<br>The other options are secretive, disobedient or shift blame.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Clear explain the strategic rationale behind the policy, acknowledge employee concerns openly, and invite questions.</b>","hi":"कारण समझाना, चिंताएँ स्वीकार करना और प्रश्न आमंत्रित करना विश्वास और सुचारु परिवर्तन बनाता है।<br>अन्य विकल्प गोपनीय, अवज्ञाकारी या दोष टालने वाले हैं।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): नीति के पीछे के रणनीतिक कारण को स्पष्ट रूप से समझाएँगे, कर्मचारियों की चिंताओं को खुलकर स्वीकार करेंगे और प्रश्न आमंत्रित करेंगे। है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":22,"local_id":"50022","quid":"Q1000074802","section":"REASONING","topic":"Statement & Conclusion","question":{"en":"In the following question, one statement is given, followed by certain inferences. Consider the statement to be true even if it seems to contradict commonly known facts. Read the inferences carefully and decide which of them logically follow from the given statement.<br><b>Statement:</b><br>It has been reported that a significant number of cotton farmers are taking their own lives because of insufficient rainfall, which is causing crop failure and drought-like situations.<br><b>Inferences:</b><br>I. Farmers involved in cultivating crops other than cotton are not facing incidents of suicide.<br>II. The growth of cotton crops depends on the availability of adequate rainfall. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित प्रश्न में एक कथन और उसके बाद कुछ अनुमान दिए गए हैं। कथन को सत्य मानिए, भले ही वह सामान्य रूप से ज्ञात तथ्यों के विपरीत प्रतीत हो। अनुमानों को ध्यानपूर्वक पढ़िए और तय कीजिए कि उनमें से कौन-से दिए गए कथन का तार्किक रूप से अनुसरण करते हैं।<br><b>कथन:</b><br>यह बताया गया है कि अपर्याप्त वर्षा के कारण, जिससे फसल नष्ट हो रही है और सूखे जैसी स्थिति बन रही है, बड़ी संख्या में कपास किसान आत्महत्या कर रहे हैं।<br><b>अनुमान:</b><br>I. कपास के अलावा अन्य फसलें उगाने वाले किसानों में आत्महत्या की घटनाएँ नहीं हो रही हैं।<br>II. कपास की फसल की वृद्धि पर्याप्त वर्षा की उपलब्धता पर निर्भर करती है। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Only Inference I follows.","hi":"केवल अनुमान I अनुसरण करता है।"},"2":{"en":"Only Inference II follows.","hi":"केवल अनुमान II अनुसरण करता है।"},"3":{"en":"Both Inferences I and II follow.","hi":"अनुमान I और II दोनों अनुसरण करते हैं।"},"4":{"en":"Neither Inference I nor Inference II follows.","hi":"न तो अनुमान I और न ही अनुमान II अनुसरण करता है।"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"The statement says nothing about other farmers: I ✗<br>Low rainfall causes cotton crop failure, so cotton depends on adequate rain: II ✔<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): Only Inference II follows.</b>","hi":"कथन अन्य किसानों के बारे में कुछ नहीं कहता: I ✗<br>कम वर्षा से कपास की फसल नष्ट होती है, अतः कपास पर्याप्त वर्षा पर निर्भर है: II ✔<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): केवल अनुमान II अनुसरण करता है। है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":23,"local_id":"50023","quid":"Q1000074803","section":"REASONING","topic":"Statement & Course of Action","question":{"en":"Direction:<br>Choose the most logical course of action.<br>An organization notices that one regional office consistently exceeds performance targets, but an audit reveals practices that technically comply with regulations while potentially creating ethical concerns. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निर्देश:<br>सबसे तार्किक कार्यवाही चुनिए।<br>एक संगठन देखता है कि एक क्षेत्रीय कार्यालय लगातार प्रदर्शन लक्ष्यों से अधिक काम करता है, लेकिन एक ऑडिट से ऐसी प्रथाओं का पता चलता है जो तकनीकी रूप से नियमों का पालन करती हैं पर नैतिक चिंताएँ पैदा कर सकती हैं। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Reward the office solely on the basis of its performance outcomes.","hi":"केवल प्रदर्शन परिणामों के आधार पर कार्यालय को पुरस्कृत करेंगे।"},"2":{"en":"Penalize the office immediately without reviewing the specific practices involved.","hi":"संबंधित प्रथाओं की समीक्षा किए बिना कार्यालय को तुरंत दंडित करेंगे।"},"3":{"en":"Examine the practices thoroughly and align performance incentives with ethical standards.","hi":"प्रथाओं की गहन जाँच करेंगे और प्रदर्शन प्रोत्साहनों को नैतिक मानकों के अनुरूप करेंगे।"},"4":{"en":"Ignore the concerns because no formal regulatory violation has occurred.","hi":"चिंताओं को अनदेखा करेंगे क्योंकि कोई औपचारिक नियम उल्लंघन नहीं हुआ है।"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"The concern must be examined, not ignored or punished blindly.<br>Reviewing the practices and linking incentives to ethics fixes the root problem.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Examine the practices thoroughly and align performance incentives with ethical standards.</b>","hi":"चिंता की जाँच होनी चाहिए, उसे अनदेखा या बिना सोचे दंडित नहीं करना चाहिए।<br>प्रथाओं की समीक्षा और प्रोत्साहनों को नैतिकता से जोड़ना मूल समस्या का समाधान है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): प्रथाओं की गहन जाँच करेंगे और प्रदर्शन प्रोत्साहनों को नैतिक मानकों के अनुरूप करेंगे। है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":24,"local_id":"50024","quid":"Q1000074804","section":"REASONING","topic":"Odd One Out","question":{"en":"In the following question, out of the five figures marked (a), (b), (c), (d), and (e), four are similar in a certain manner. However, one figure is not like the other four. Choose the figure which is different from the rest.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q24.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित प्रश्न में, (a), (b), (c), (d) और (e) से चिह्नित पाँच आकृतियों में से चार किसी प्रकार समान हैं। लेकिन एक आकृति अन्य चार जैसी नहीं है। उस आकृति को चुनिए जो बाकी से भिन्न है।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q24.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"c"},"2":{"en":"a"},"3":{"en":"e"},"4":{"en":"d"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"(a), (b), (d) and (e) have the shaded triangles in the same relative pattern, only rotated.<br>(c) breaks this pattern, so it is the odd one.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): c.</b>","hi":"(a), (b), (d) और (e) में छायांकित त्रिभुज एक ही सापेक्ष पैटर्न में हैं, केवल घुमाए गए हैं।<br>(c) इस पैटर्न को तोड़ती है, अतः वह भिन्न है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): c है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q24.jpg"]}},{"no":25,"local_id":"50025","quid":"Q1000074805","section":"REASONING","topic":"Letter & Alphanumeric Series","question":{"en":"Fill in the blanks (_) using one of the following four options such that the series follows a specific pattern in the given order.<br>xyz _ xy _ ax _ za _ yza [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित चार विकल्पों में से किसी एक का उपयोग करके रिक्त स्थान (_) भरिए ताकि श्रृंखला दिए गए क्रम में एक विशेष पैटर्न का पालन करे।<br>xyz _ xy _ ax _ za _ yza [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"ayxz"},"2":{"en":"zyax"},"3":{"en":"zxya"},"4":{"en":"azyx"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"Filling a, z, y, x gives: xyza / xyza / xyza / xyza<br>The block \"xyza\" repeats.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): azyx.</b>","hi":"a, z, y, x भरने पर: xyza / xyza / xyza / xyza<br>खंड \"xyza\" दोहराया जाता है।<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): azyx है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false}]},"GK":{"seconds":900,"questions":[{"no":26,"local_id":"50026","quid":"Q1000074806","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Sports(Static & Current)","question":{"en":"P V Sindhu became the first Indian to win the Badminton World Championship in the year _______. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"पी वी सिंधु वर्ष _______ में बैडमिंटन विश्व चैंपियनशिप जीतने वाली पहली भारतीय बनीं। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2016"},"2":{"en":"2019"},"3":{"en":"2012"},"4":{"en":"2008"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – 2019</b><br><b>P.V. Sindhu</b> won the <b>BWF World Championships</b> women's singles title at <b>Basel, Switzerland</b> in <b><u>2019</u></b>, beating Nozomi Okuhara in the final.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Sindhu won Olympic <b>silver (Rio 2016)</b> and <b>bronze (Tokyo 2020)</b>.<br>• She is the first Indian woman to win <b>two individual Olympic medals</b>.<br>• She received the <b>Padma Bhushan (2020)</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – 2019</b><br><b>पी.वी. सिंधु</b> ने <b><u>2019</u></b> में <b>बासेल, स्विट्ज़रलैंड</b> में फाइनल में नोज़ोमी ओकुहारा को हराकर <b>BWF विश्व चैंपियनशिप</b> महिला एकल खिताब जीता।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• सिंधु ने ओलंपिक <b>रजत (रियो 2016)</b> और <b>कांस्य (टोक्यो 2020)</b> जीता।<br>• वह <b>दो व्यक्तिगत ओलंपिक पदक</b> जीतने वाली पहली भारतीय महिला हैं।<br>• उन्हें <b>पद्म भूषण (2020)</b> मिला।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":27,"local_id":"50027","quid":"Q1000074807","section":"GK","topic":"Economics: Reports and Indices","question":{"en":"Which of the following countries has an HDI value classified as \"Very High Human Development\"? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित में से किस देश का HDI मान \"अति उच्च मानव विकास\" श्रेणी में है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"India","hi":"भारत"},"2":{"en":"Brazil","hi":"ब्राज़ील"},"3":{"en":"Japan","hi":"जापान"},"4":{"en":"Chad","hi":"चाड"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – Japan</b><br><b><u>Japan</u></b> has an HDI above 0.9 and falls in the <b>\"Very High Human Development\"</b> category. India is in the medium category, Brazil high and Chad low.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• HDI categories: <b>Very High (≥0.800), High (0.700–0.799), Medium (0.550–0.699), Low (&lt;0.550)</b>.<br>• India ranked <b>130<sup>th</sup></b> in HDR 2025 (HDI 0.685).<br>• Top-ranked country in recent reports: <b>Iceland</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – जापान</b><br><b><u>जापान</u></b> का HDI 0.9 से अधिक है और यह <b>\"अति उच्च मानव विकास\"</b> श्रेणी में है। भारत मध्यम, ब्राज़ील उच्च और चाड निम्न श्रेणी में है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• HDI श्रेणियाँ: <b>अति उच्च (≥0.800), उच्च (0.700–0.799), मध्यम (0.550–0.699), निम्न (&lt;0.550)</b>।<br>• मानव विकास रिपोर्ट 2025 में भारत <b>130वें</b> स्थान पर (HDI 0.685)।<br>• हाल की रिपोर्टों में शीर्ष देश: <b>आइसलैंड</b>।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":28,"local_id":"50028","quid":"Q1000074808","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Sports(Static & Current)","question":{"en":"Which organization is responsible for monitoring and regulating the use of performance-enhancing drugs in sports? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"खेलों में प्रदर्शन-वर्धक दवाओं के उपयोग की निगरानी और विनियमन के लिए कौन-सा संगठन उत्तरदायी है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"International Olympic Committee (IOC)","hi":"अंतर्राष्ट्रीय ओलंपिक समिति (IOC)"},"2":{"en":"World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)","hi":"विश्व डोपिंग रोधी एजेंसी (WADA)"},"3":{"en":"National Anti-Doping Agency (NADA)","hi":"राष्ट्रीय डोपिंग रोधी एजेंसी (NADA)"},"4":{"en":"International Association of Athletics Federations (IAAF)","hi":"अंतर्राष्ट्रीय एथलेटिक्स महासंघ संघ (IAAF)"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)</b><br>The <b><u>World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA)</u></b>, set up in <b>1999</b>, monitors and regulates the use of performance-enhancing drugs in sports worldwide through the <b>World Anti-Doping Code</b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• WADA HQ: <b>Montreal, Canada</b>.<br>• <b>NADA</b> is India's national body (2005).<br>• IAAF is now called <b>World Athletics</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – विश्व डोपिंग रोधी एजेंसी (WADA)</b><br><b>1999</b> में स्थापित <b><u>विश्व डोपिंग रोधी एजेंसी (WADA)</u></b> <b>विश्व डोपिंग रोधी संहिता</b> के माध्यम से विश्व भर में खेलों में प्रदर्शन-वर्धक दवाओं के उपयोग की निगरानी और विनियमन करती है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• WADA मुख्यालय: <b>मॉन्ट्रियल, कनाडा</b>।<br>• <b>NADA</b> भारत की राष्ट्रीय संस्था (2005) है।<br>• IAAF का नाम अब <b>वर्ल्ड एथलेटिक्स</b> है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":29,"local_id":"50029","quid":"Q1000074809","section":"GK","topic":"Polity: Parliament","question":{"en":"<b>Consider the following statements:</b><br>1. Rajya Sabha can allow Parliament to make laws on State List.<br>2. Rajya Sabha can amend Money Bills and delay them for 14 days.<br>Which of the above statements is/are <b>correct?</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>निम्नलिखित कथनों पर विचार कीजिए:</b><br>1. राज्यसभा संसद को राज्य सूची पर कानून बनाने की अनुमति दे सकती है।<br>2. राज्यसभा धन विधेयकों में संशोधन कर सकती है और उन्हें 14 दिनों तक रोक सकती है।<br>उपर्युक्त कथनों में से कौन-सा/से <b>सही</b> है/हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Only 1","hi":"केवल 1"},"2":{"en":"Only 2","hi":"केवल 2"},"3":{"en":"Both 1 and 2","hi":"1 और 2 दोनों"},"4":{"en":"Neither 1 nor 2","hi":"न तो 1 और न ही 2"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (1) – Only 1</b><br>Under <b>Article 249</b>, the Rajya Sabha can authorise Parliament to legislate on a State List subject – correct. The Rajya Sabha <b>cannot amend</b> a Money Bill; it can only make recommendations within 14 days – statement 2 is wrong. Hence <b><u>Only 1</u></b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Money Bills are introduced only in the <b>Lok Sabha</b> (Art. 109).<br>• Rajya Sabha can also create new <b>All-India Services</b> (Art. 312).<br>• The Lok Sabha may accept or reject Rajya Sabha's recommendations on a Money Bill.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (1) – केवल 1</b><br><b>अनुच्छेद 249</b> के तहत राज्यसभा संसद को राज्य सूची के विषय पर कानून बनाने के लिए अधिकृत कर सकती है – सही। राज्यसभा धन विधेयक में <b>संशोधन नहीं</b> कर सकती; वह केवल 14 दिनों के भीतर सिफारिशें दे सकती है – कथन 2 गलत। अतः <b><u>केवल 1</u></b>।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• धन विधेयक केवल <b>लोकसभा</b> में पेश होते हैं (अनु. 109)।<br>• राज्यसभा नई <b>अखिल भारतीय सेवाएँ</b> भी बना सकती है (अनु. 312)।<br>• लोकसभा धन विधेयक पर राज्यसभा की सिफारिशें मान या अस्वीकार कर सकती है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":30,"local_id":"50030","quid":"Q1000074810","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Music and Musical Instruments","question":{"en":"In which Indian musical tradition is the \"Mridangam\" a significant percussion instrument? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"किस भारतीय संगीत परंपरा में \"मृदंगम\" एक महत्वपूर्ण ताल वाद्य है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Sufi","hi":"सूफ़ी"},"2":{"en":"Tala","hi":"ताल"},"3":{"en":"Tabla","hi":"तबला"},"4":{"en":"Carnatic Classical","hi":"कर्नाटक शास्त्रीय"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (4) – Carnatic Classical</b><br>The <b>Mridangam</b>, a double-headed barrel drum, is the main percussion instrument of <b><u>Carnatic classical music</u></b> (South India).<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Famous mridangam players: <b>Palghat Mani Iyer, Umayalpuram K. Sivaraman</b>.<br>• Other Carnatic percussion: <b>ghatam, kanjira, morsing</b>.<br>• The <b>tabla</b> and <b>pakhawaj</b> are used in Hindustani music.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (4) – कर्नाटक शास्त्रीय</b><br><b>मृदंगम</b>, दो मुख वाला बेलनाकार ढोल, <b><u>कर्नाटक शास्त्रीय संगीत</u></b> (दक्षिण भारत) का मुख्य ताल वाद्य है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• प्रसिद्ध मृदंगम वादक: <b>पालघाट मणि अय्यर, उमयालपुरम के. शिवरामन</b>।<br>• अन्य कर्नाटक ताल वाद्य: <b>घटम, कंजीरा, मोरसिंग</b>।<br>• <b>तबला</b> और <b>पखावज</b> हिंदुस्तानी संगीत में प्रयुक्त होते हैं।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":31,"local_id":"50031","quid":"Q1000074811","section":"GK","topic":"Medieval History: The Mughal Empire","question":{"en":"Which Mughal emperor commissioned the construction of the Taj Mahal? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"किस मुग़ल सम्राट ने ताजमहल का निर्माण करवाया? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Akbar","hi":"अकबर"},"2":{"en":"Shah Jahan","hi":"शाहजहाँ"},"3":{"en":"Humayun","hi":"हुमायूँ"},"4":{"en":"Aurangzeb","hi":"औरंगज़ेब"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – Shah Jahan</b><br><b><u>Shah Jahan</u></b> built the <b>Taj Mahal</b> at Agra in memory of his wife <b>Mumtaz Mahal</b>; it was completed in about <b>1653</b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Chief architect: <b>Ustad Ahmad Lahauri</b>.<br>• UNESCO World Heritage Site since <b>1983</b>; one of the <b>New Seven Wonders</b>.<br>• Shah Jahan's reign is called the <b>\"Golden Age of Mughal architecture\"</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – शाहजहाँ</b><br><b><u>शाहजहाँ</u></b> ने अपनी पत्नी <b>मुमताज़ महल</b> की स्मृति में आगरा में <b>ताजमहल</b> बनवाया; यह लगभग <b>1653</b> में पूर्ण हुआ।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• मुख्य वास्तुकार: <b>उस्ताद अहमद लाहौरी</b>।<br>• <b>1983</b> से यूनेस्को विश्व धरोहर स्थल; <b>नए सात अजूबों</b> में शामिल।<br>• शाहजहाँ के शासनकाल को <b>\"मुग़ल स्थापत्य का स्वर्ण युग\"</b> कहा जाता है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":32,"local_id":"50032","quid":"Q1000074812","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Music and Musical Instruments","question":{"en":"Which of the following pairs is <b>incorrectly</b> matched? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा युग्म <b>गलत</b> सुमेलित है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Kumar Gandharva – Guitar","hi":"कुमार गंधर्व – गिटार"},"2":{"en":"Dwaram Venkataswamy Naidu – Violin","hi":"द्वारम वेंकटस्वामी नायडू – वायलिन"},"3":{"en":"Vikku Vinayakram – Ghatam","hi":"विक्कु विनायकराम – घटम"},"4":{"en":"Pandit Nikhil Jyoti Ghosh – Tabla","hi":"पंडित निखिल ज्योति घोष – तबला"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (1) – Kumar Gandharva – Guitar</b><br><b><u>Kumar Gandharva</u></b> was a renowned <b>Hindustani classical vocalist</b>, not a guitarist. So \"Kumar Gandharva – Guitar\" is incorrectly matched.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Kumar Gandharva was known for <b>Nirguni bhajans</b> and was awarded the <b>Padma Vibhushan (1990)</b>.<br>• <b>Vikku Vinayakram</b> – ghatam maestro, Grammy winner (with Shakti).<br>• Indian guitarists: <b>Brij Bhushan Kabra</b> (Hawaiian guitar), <b>Debashish Bhattacharya</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (1) – कुमार गंधर्व – गिटार</b><br><b><u>कुमार गंधर्व</u></b> प्रसिद्ध <b>हिंदुस्तानी शास्त्रीय गायक</b> थे, गिटार वादक नहीं। अतः \"कुमार गंधर्व – गिटार\" गलत सुमेलित है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• कुमार गंधर्व <b>निर्गुणी भजनों</b> के लिए प्रसिद्ध थे और उन्हें <b>पद्म विभूषण (1990)</b> मिला।<br>• <b>विक्कु विनायकराम</b> – घटम उस्ताद, ग्रैमी विजेता (शक्ति के साथ)।<br>• भारतीय गिटार वादक: <b>बृज भूषण काबरा</b> (हवाईयन गिटार), <b>देबाशीष भट्टाचार्य</b>।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":33,"local_id":"50033","quid":"Q1000074813","section":"GK","topic":"Science and Technology: Science and Technology","question":{"en":"How will VSAR’s 20–30 m mapping capability most significantly impact future studies of Venus? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"VSAR की 20–30 m मानचित्रण क्षमता शुक्र के भविष्य के अध्ययनों को सबसे अधिक कैसे प्रभावित करेगी? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"It will enable real-time weather forecasting on Venus.","hi":"यह शुक्र पर वास्तविक समय मौसम पूर्वानुमान संभव करेगा।"},"2":{"en":"It will map impact craters with detailed ejecta and melt features.","hi":"यह विस्तृत इजेक्टा और पिघलन विशेषताओं के साथ प्रहार क्रेटरों का मानचित्रण करेगा।"},"3":{"en":"It will eliminate the need for optical imagers on the spacecraft.","hi":"यह अंतरिक्ष यान पर प्रकाशीय इमेजरों की आवश्यकता समाप्त कर देगा।"},"4":{"en":"It will map the planet’s magnetic field with greater accuracy.","hi":"यह ग्रह के चुंबकीय क्षेत्र का अधिक सटीकता से मानचित्रण करेगा।"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – It will map impact craters with detailed ejecta and melt features.</b><br><b>VSAR (Venus Synthetic Aperture Radar)</b> on ISRO's <b>Venus Orbiter Mission</b> can image through Venus's thick clouds at <b>20–30 m resolution</b>, enough to <b><u>map impact craters with their ejecta and melt features</u></b> in detail.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• The <b>Venus Orbiter Mission (Shukrayaan)</b> was approved by the Union Cabinet in <b>September 2024</b>.<br>• Radar is needed because Venus is covered by thick <b>sulphuric acid clouds</b>.<br>• Venus is the <b>hottest planet</b> and rotates retrograde (east to west).","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – यह विस्तृत इजेक्टा और पिघलन विशेषताओं के साथ प्रहार क्रेटरों का मानचित्रण करेगा।</b><br>ISRO के <b>शुक्र कक्षित्र मिशन</b> पर <b>VSAR (वीनस सिंथेटिक अपर्चर रडार)</b> शुक्र के घने बादलों के पार <b>20–30 m विभेदन</b> पर चित्र ले सकता है, जो <b><u>प्रहार क्रेटरों को उनके इजेक्टा और पिघलन विशेषताओं सहित विस्तार से मानचित्रित</u></b> करने के लिए पर्याप्त है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>शुक्र कक्षित्र मिशन (शुक्रयान)</b> को केंद्रीय मंत्रिमंडल ने <b>सितंबर 2024</b> में स्वीकृति दी।<br>• रडार इसलिए आवश्यक है क्योंकि शुक्र घने <b>सल्फ्यूरिक अम्ल के बादलों</b> से ढका है।<br>• शुक्र <b>सबसे गर्म ग्रह</b> है और प्रतिगामी (पूर्व से पश्चिम) घूमता है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":34,"local_id":"50034","quid":"Q1000074814","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Sports(Static & Current)","question":{"en":"<b>Fill in the blanks:</b><br>18<sup>th</sup> Circle Style National Kabaddi Championship (Women) was held in _____ [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>रिक्त स्थान भरिए:</b><br>18वीं सर्कल स्टाइल राष्ट्रीय कबड्डी चैंपियनशिप (महिला) _____ में आयोजित हुई। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Charkhi Dadri","hi":"चरखी दादरी"},"2":{"en":"Patiala","hi":"पटियाला"},"3":{"en":"Jaipur","hi":"जयपुर"},"4":{"en":"Amritsar","hi":"अमृतसर"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (1) – Charkhi Dadri</b><br>The <b>18<sup>th</sup> Circle Style National Kabaddi Championship</b> (2025) was held in <b>Haryana</b>, at <b><u>Charkhi Dadri</u></b>, under the Amateur Kabaddi Federation of India (AKFI).<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• <b>Circle style kabaddi</b> (Punjabi kabaddi) is played on a circular pitch, unlike the standard rectangular court.<br>• Kabaddi in India is governed by the <b>Amateur Kabaddi Federation of India (AKFI)</b>.<br>• Circle Style Kabaddi World Cups have been hosted mainly in <b>Punjab</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (1) – चरखी दादरी</b><br><b>18वीं सर्कल स्टाइल राष्ट्रीय कबड्डी चैंपियनशिप</b> (2025) <b>हरियाणा</b> के <b><u>चरखी दादरी</u></b> में भारतीय एमेच्योर कबड्डी महासंघ (AKFI) के अधीन आयोजित हुई।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>सर्कल स्टाइल कबड्डी</b> (पंजाबी कबड्डी) मानक आयताकार कोर्ट के बजाय वृत्ताकार मैदान पर खेली जाती है।<br>• भारत में कबड्डी का शासी निकाय <b>भारतीय एमेच्योर कबड्डी महासंघ (AKFI)</b> है।<br>• सर्कल स्टाइल कबड्डी विश्व कप मुख्यतः <b>पंजाब</b> में आयोजित हुए हैं।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":35,"local_id":"50035","quid":"Q1000074815","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"<b>Which of the following pairs is/are correct :</b><br>1. Meenakshi Sundareswarar Temple- Dravidian<br>2. Dilwara Jain Temples - Jain (Maru-Gurjara / Solanki Nagara)<br>3. Gol Gumbaz -Indo-Islamic / Deccan Sultanate [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"<b>निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा/से युग्म सही है/हैं:</b><br>1. मीनाक्षी सुंदरेश्वर मंदिर - द्रविड़<br>2. दिलवाड़ा जैन मंदिर - जैन (मारु-गुर्जर / सोलंकी नागर)<br>3. गोल गुंबज़ - हिंद-इस्लामी / दक्कन सल्तनत [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Only 1 and 2","hi":"केवल 1 और 2"},"2":{"en":"Only 2 and 3","hi":"केवल 2 और 3"},"3":{"en":"1, 2 and 3","hi":"1, 2 और 3"},"4":{"en":"Only 1","hi":"केवल 1"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – 1, 2 and 3</b><br><b>Meenakshi Temple (Madurai)</b> is a classic <b>Dravidian</b> temple; <b>Dilwara Temples (Mount Abu)</b> follow the <b>Maru-Gurjara (Solanki)</b> style; <b>Gol Gumbaz (Bijapur)</b> is <b>Deccan Indo-Islamic</b>. All are correct: <b><u>1, 2 and 3</u></b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Dilwara temples (11<sup>th</sup>–13<sup>th</sup> century) are famous for intricate <b>white marble carving</b>.<br>• Gol Gumbaz is the tomb of <b>Muhammad Adil Shah</b>, with a famous whispering gallery.<br>• Dravidian temples have <b>vimana</b> and tall <b>gopurams</b>; Nagara temples have <b>shikhara</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – 1, 2 और 3</b><br><b>मीनाक्षी मंदिर (मदुरै)</b> विशिष्ट <b>द्रविड़</b> मंदिर है; <b>दिलवाड़ा मंदिर (माउंट आबू)</b> <b>मारु-गुर्जर (सोलंकी)</b> शैली के हैं; <b>गोल गुंबज़ (बीजापुर)</b> <b>दक्कनी हिंद-इस्लामी</b> है। सभी सही हैं: <b><u>1, 2 और 3</u></b>।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• दिलवाड़ा मंदिर (11वीं–13वीं शताब्दी) <b>सफ़ेद संगमरमर की बारीक नक्काशी</b> के लिए प्रसिद्ध हैं।<br>• गोल गुंबज़ <b>मुहम्मद आदिल शाह</b> का मकबरा है, जिसमें प्रसिद्ध फुसफुसाती गैलरी है।<br>• द्रविड़ मंदिरों में <b>विमान</b> और ऊँचे <b>गोपुरम</b>; नागर मंदिरों में <b>शिखर</b> होते हैं।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":36,"local_id":"50036","quid":"Q1000074816","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Government Schemes","question":{"en":"Which flagship scheme was launched to double farmers’ income and improve agricultural infrastructure? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"किसानों की आय दोगुनी करने और कृषि अवसंरचना में सुधार के लिए कौन-सी प्रमुख योजना शुरू की गई? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Krishi Sinchai Yojana","hi":"कृषि सिंचाई योजना"},"2":{"en":"PM-KISAN","hi":"पीएम-किसान"},"3":{"en":"Pradhan Mantri Kisan MaanDhan Yojana (PM-KMY)","hi":"प्रधानमंत्री किसान मानधन योजना (PM-KMY)"},"4":{"en":"PM Fasal Bima Yojana","hi":"पीएम फसल बीमा योजना"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – PM-KISAN</b><br><b><u>PM-KISAN</u></b> (2019) gives <b>₹6,000 per year</b> income support to farmers to help meet farm input costs and is a key part of the government's goal of <b>doubling farmers' income</b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• <b>PM Krishi Sinchai Yojana (2015)</b> – \"Har Khet Ko Pani\", \"Per Drop More Crop\".<br>• <b>PM Kisan Maandhan (2019)</b> – ₹3,000/month pension for small farmers after 60.<br>• <b>PM Fasal Bima Yojana (2016)</b> – crop insurance.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – पीएम-किसान</b><br><b><u>पीएम-किसान</u></b> (2019) किसानों को कृषि लागत में मदद के लिए <b>₹6,000 प्रति वर्ष</b> आय सहायता देती है और यह <b>किसानों की आय दोगुनी</b> करने के सरकारी लक्ष्य का प्रमुख भाग है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>प्रधानमंत्री कृषि सिंचाई योजना (2015)</b> – \"हर खेत को पानी\", \"प्रति बूँद अधिक फसल\"।<br>• <b>पीएम किसान मानधन (2019)</b> – 60 वर्ष के बाद छोटे किसानों को ₹3,000/माह पेंशन।<br>• <b>पीएम फसल बीमा योजना (2016)</b> – फसल बीमा।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":37,"local_id":"50037","quid":"Q1000074817","section":"GK","topic":"Polity: New Criminal Laws 2023","question":{"en":"What is the difference between a bailable and non-bailable offence under BNSS? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"BNSS के तहत ज़मानतीय और गैर-ज़मानतीय अपराध में क्या अंतर है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Non-bailable offences can be compounded by the police","hi":"गैर-ज़मानतीय अपराधों का पुलिस द्वारा शमन किया जा सकता है"},"2":{"en":"Bailable offences are not punishable","hi":"ज़मानतीय अपराध दंडनीय नहीं हैं"},"3":{"en":"Bailable offences are listed in the First Schedule","hi":"ज़मानतीय अपराध प्रथम अनुसूची में सूचीबद्ध हैं"},"4":{"en":"Non-bailable offences can be granted bail by any officer","hi":"गैर-ज़मानतीय अपराधों में कोई भी अधिकारी ज़मानत दे सकता है"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – Bailable offences are listed in the First Schedule</b><br>Under <b>Section 2 of BNSS</b>, a \"bailable offence\" means an offence <b><u>shown as bailable in the First Schedule</u></b> or made bailable by any other law; all others are non-bailable.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• In a bailable offence, bail is a <b>matter of right</b>; in a non-bailable offence, it is at the <b>court's discretion</b>.<br>• The First Schedule also classifies offences as cognizable/non-cognizable.<br>• BNSS replaced the CrPC from <b>1 July 2024</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – ज़मानतीय अपराध प्रथम अनुसूची में सूचीबद्ध हैं</b><br><b>BNSS की धारा 2</b> के तहत \"ज़मानतीय अपराध\" वह अपराध है जो <b><u>प्रथम अनुसूची में ज़मानतीय दिखाया गया</u></b> हो या किसी अन्य कानून द्वारा ज़मानतीय बनाया गया हो; शेष सभी गैर-ज़मानतीय हैं।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• ज़मानतीय अपराध में ज़मानत <b>अधिकार का विषय</b> है; गैर-ज़मानतीय में यह <b>न्यायालय के विवेक</b> पर है।<br>• प्रथम अनुसूची अपराधों को संज्ञेय/असंज्ञेय में भी वर्गीकृत करती है।<br>• BNSS ने <b>1 जुलाई 2024</b> से CrPC का स्थान लिया।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":38,"local_id":"50038","quid":"Q1000074818","section":"GK","topic":"Physics: Electricity","question":{"en":"What is the SI unit of electric current? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"विद्युत धारा का SI मात्रक क्या है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Volt","hi":"वोल्ट"},"2":{"en":"Ohm","hi":"ओम"},"3":{"en":"Ampere","hi":"एम्पियर"},"4":{"en":"Watt","hi":"वाट"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – Ampere</b><br>The SI unit of electric current is the <b><u>ampere (A)</u></b>, one of the seven SI base units.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• 1 ampere = 1 coulomb per second (\\(I = \\frac{Q}{t}\\)).<br>• <b>Volt</b> – potential difference; <b>Ohm</b> – resistance; <b>Watt</b> – power.<br>• Current is measured by an <b>ammeter</b>, connected in series.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – एम्पियर</b><br>विद्युत धारा का SI मात्रक <b><u>एम्पियर (A)</u></b> है, जो सात SI मूल मात्रकों में से एक है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• 1 एम्पियर = 1 कूलॉम प्रति सेकंड (\\(I = \\frac{Q}{t}\\))।<br>• <b>वोल्ट</b> – विभवांतर; <b>ओम</b> – प्रतिरोध; <b>वाट</b> – शक्ति।<br>• धारा <b>एमीटर</b> से मापी जाती है, जो श्रेणी में जोड़ा जाता है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":39,"local_id":"50039","quid":"Q1000074819","section":"GK","topic":"Economics: Microeconomics","question":{"en":"The Break-event Chart portrays the relationship between: [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"ब्रेक-ईवन चार्ट किसके बीच संबंध को दर्शाता है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Price, cost, profit","hi":"कीमत, लागत, लाभ"},"2":{"en":"Cost, volume, profit","hi":"लागत, मात्रा, लाभ"},"3":{"en":"Price, sales, profit","hi":"कीमत, बिक्री, लाभ"},"4":{"en":"Cost, sales, production","hi":"लागत, बिक्री, उत्पादन"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – Cost, volume, profit</b><br>A <b>break-even chart</b> shows the <b><u>cost–volume–profit (CVP)</u></b> relationship; the break-even point is where total revenue equals total cost (no profit, no loss).<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Break-even point (units) = \\(\\frac{\\text{Fixed cost}}{\\text{Price} - \\text{Variable cost per unit}}\\).<br>• Price − variable cost per unit is called <b>contribution</b>.<br>• Sales above the break-even point give the <b>margin of safety</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – लागत, मात्रा, लाभ</b><br><b>ब्रेक-ईवन चार्ट</b> <b><u>लागत–मात्रा–लाभ (CVP)</u></b> संबंध दर्शाता है; ब्रेक-ईवन बिंदु वह है जहाँ कुल आय कुल लागत के बराबर होती है (न लाभ, न हानि)।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• ब्रेक-ईवन बिंदु (इकाइयाँ) = \\(\\frac{\\text{Fixed cost}}{\\text{Price} - \\text{Variable cost per unit}}\\)।<br>• कीमत − प्रति इकाई परिवर्ती लागत को <b>अंशदान (Contribution)</b> कहते हैं।<br>• ब्रेक-ईवन बिंदु से अधिक बिक्री <b>सुरक्षा सीमा</b> देती है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":40,"local_id":"50040","quid":"Q1000074820","section":"GK","topic":"Geography: Solar System","question":{"en":"Which among the following is/are the motion(s) of the Earth:<br>1. Revolution<br>2. Rotation<br>3. Reflection<br>Which of the given option is/are correct? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सी पृथ्वी की गति है/हैं:<br>1. परिक्रमण<br>2. घूर्णन<br>3. परावर्तन<br>दिए गए विकल्पों में से कौन-सा/से सही है/हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"1 and 2","hi":"1 और 2"},"2":{"en":"1 and 3","hi":"1 और 3"},"3":{"en":"3 only","hi":"केवल 3"},"4":{"en":"1, 2 and 3","hi":"1, 2 और 3"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (1) – 1 and 2</b><br>The Earth has two motions: <b>rotation</b> on its axis (causing day and night) and <b>revolution</b> around the Sun (causing seasons). Reflection is not a motion. Hence <b><u>1 and 2</u></b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Rotation takes about <b>23 hours 56 minutes</b>; revolution about <b>365¼ days</b>.<br>• The Earth's axis is inclined at <b>66½°</b> to the orbital plane (23½° from vertical).<br>• Perihelion (closest to Sun) – about <b>3 January</b>; aphelion – about <b>4 July</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (1) – 1 और 2</b><br>पृथ्वी की दो गतियाँ हैं: अपने अक्ष पर <b>घूर्णन</b> (दिन और रात) और सूर्य के चारों ओर <b>परिक्रमण</b> (ऋतुएँ)। परावर्तन गति नहीं है। अतः <b><u>1 और 2</u></b>।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• घूर्णन में लगभग <b>23 घंटे 56 मिनट</b>; परिक्रमण में लगभग <b>365¼ दिन</b> लगते हैं।<br>• पृथ्वी का अक्ष कक्षीय तल से <b>66½°</b> (ऊर्ध्वाधर से 23½°) झुका है।<br>• उपसौर (सूर्य के निकटतम) – लगभग <b>3 जनवरी</b>; अपसौर – लगभग <b>4 जुलाई</b>।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":41,"local_id":"50041","quid":"Q1000074821","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Census","question":{"en":"Which of the following states has the highest percentage of Scheduled Tribes as per Census 2011? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"जनगणना 2011 के अनुसार निम्नलिखित में से किस राज्य में अनुसूचित जनजातियों का प्रतिशत सर्वाधिक है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Odisha","hi":"ओडिशा"},"2":{"en":"Chhattisgarh","hi":"छत्तीसगढ़"},"3":{"en":"Mizoram","hi":"मिज़ोरम"},"4":{"en":"Madhya Pradesh","hi":"मध्य प्रदेश"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – Mizoram</b><br>As per Census 2011, <b><u>Mizoram</u></b> has the highest proportion of Scheduled Tribes – about <b>94.4%</b> of its population.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Largest ST population in absolute numbers: <b>Madhya Pradesh</b>.<br>• STs form about <b>8.6%</b> of India's population.<br>• Lowest ST share among states: <b>Uttar Pradesh</b>; Punjab and Haryana have no notified STs.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – मिज़ोरम</b><br>जनगणना 2011 के अनुसार <b><u>मिज़ोरम</u></b> में अनुसूचित जनजातियों का अनुपात सर्वाधिक है – जनसंख्या का लगभग <b>94.4%</b>।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• कुल संख्या में सर्वाधिक ST जनसंख्या: <b>मध्य प्रदेश</b>।<br>• ST भारत की जनसंख्या का लगभग <b>8.6%</b> हैं।<br>• राज्यों में सबसे कम ST हिस्सा: <b>उत्तर प्रदेश</b>; पंजाब और हरियाणा में कोई अधिसूचित ST नहीं है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":42,"local_id":"50042","quid":"Q1000074822","section":"GK","topic":"Polity: Prime Minister and Council of Ministers","question":{"en":"The real executive power in the Indian Union is exercised by: [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"भारतीय संघ में वास्तविक कार्यपालिका शक्ति का प्रयोग कौन करता है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"The President","hi":"राष्ट्रपति"},"2":{"en":"The Prime Minister","hi":"प्रधानमंत्री"},"3":{"en":"The Chief Justice","hi":"मुख्य न्यायाधीश"},"4":{"en":"The Parliament","hi":"संसद"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – The Prime Minister</b><br>The President is the <b>nominal (de jure)</b> executive, while the <b>Council of Ministers headed by the <u>Prime Minister</u></b> is the real (de facto) executive.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• <b>Article 74</b> – Council of Ministers headed by PM to aid and advise the President.<br>• The <b>42<sup>nd</sup> Amendment</b> made this advice binding on the President.<br>• India follows the <b>British parliamentary system</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – प्रधानमंत्री</b><br>राष्ट्रपति <b>नाममात्र (विधितः)</b> कार्यपालिका हैं, जबकि <b><u>प्रधानमंत्री</u> की अध्यक्षता वाली मंत्रिपरिषद</b> वास्तविक (वस्तुतः) कार्यपालिका है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>अनुच्छेद 74</b> – राष्ट्रपति की सहायता और सलाह के लिए प्रधानमंत्री की अध्यक्षता में मंत्रिपरिषद।<br>• <b>42वें संशोधन</b> ने यह सलाह राष्ट्रपति पर बाध्यकारी बनाई।<br>• भारत <b>ब्रिटिश संसदीय प्रणाली</b> का अनुसरण करता है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":43,"local_id":"50043","quid":"Q1000074823","section":"GK","topic":"Polity: Parliament","question":{"en":"Who presides over the joint sitting of the Parliament? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"संसद की संयुक्त बैठक की अध्यक्षता कौन करता है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"President of India","hi":"भारत के राष्ट्रपति"},"2":{"en":"Speaker of Lok Sabha","hi":"लोकसभा अध्यक्ष"},"3":{"en":"Chairman of Rajya Sabha","hi":"राज्यसभा के सभापति"},"4":{"en":"Vice President","hi":"उपराष्ट्रपति"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – Speaker of Lok Sabha</b><br>Under <b>Article 108</b> and <b>Article 118(4)</b>, a joint sitting of both Houses is presided over by the <b><u>Speaker of the Lok Sabha</u></b>; in his absence, by the Deputy Speaker, then the Deputy Chairman of Rajya Sabha.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Joint sitting is summoned by the <b>President</b> to resolve a deadlock on an ordinary bill.<br>• No joint sitting for <b>Money Bills or Constitutional Amendment Bills</b>.<br>• Joint sittings so far: <b>Dowry Prohibition (1961), Banking Service Commission (1978), POTA (2002)</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – लोकसभा अध्यक्ष</b><br><b>अनुच्छेद 108</b> और <b>अनुच्छेद 118(4)</b> के तहत दोनों सदनों की संयुक्त बैठक की अध्यक्षता <b><u>लोकसभा अध्यक्ष</u></b> करते हैं; उनकी अनुपस्थिति में उपाध्यक्ष, फिर राज्यसभा के उपसभापति।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• साधारण विधेयक पर गतिरोध दूर करने के लिए संयुक्त बैठक <b>राष्ट्रपति</b> बुलाते हैं।<br>• <b>धन विधेयक या संविधान संशोधन विधेयक</b> पर संयुक्त बैठक नहीं होती।<br>• अब तक संयुक्त बैठकें: <b>दहेज निषेध (1961), बैंकिंग सेवा आयोग (1978), POTA (2002)</b>।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":44,"local_id":"50044","quid":"Q1000074824","section":"GK","topic":"Polity: Fundamental Rights","question":{"en":"__________ is NOT covered under Article 20 of the Indian Constitution. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"__________ भारतीय संविधान के अनुच्छेद 20 के अंतर्गत नहीं आता। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Protection against self-incrimination","hi":"आत्म-अभिशंसन के विरुद्ध संरक्षण"},"2":{"en":"Principle of double jeopardy","hi":"दोहरे दंड का सिद्धांत"},"3":{"en":"Principle of ex-post facto laws","hi":"कार्योत्तर (ex-post facto) कानूनों का सिद्धांत"},"4":{"en":"Principle of legitimate expectation","hi":"वैध अपेक्षा का सिद्धांत"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (4) – Principle of legitimate expectation</b><br><b>Article 20</b> gives protection in respect of conviction: no <b>ex-post facto</b> criminal law, no <b>double jeopardy</b>, and no <b>self-incrimination</b>. The <b><u>principle of legitimate expectation</u></b> is a doctrine of administrative law, not part of Article 20.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Articles <b>20 and 21</b> cannot be suspended even during a National Emergency (44<sup>th</sup> Amendment).<br>• Art. 20(1) – ex-post facto; 20(2) – double jeopardy; 20(3) – self-incrimination.<br>• <b>Article 22</b> – protection against arbitrary arrest and detention.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (4) – वैध अपेक्षा का सिद्धांत</b><br><b>अनुच्छेद 20</b> दोषसिद्धि के संबंध में संरक्षण देता है: कोई <b>कार्योत्तर</b> आपराधिक कानून नहीं, <b>दोहरा दंड</b> नहीं, और <b>आत्म-अभिशंसन</b> नहीं। <b><u>वैध अपेक्षा का सिद्धांत</u></b> प्रशासनिक विधि का सिद्धांत है, अनुच्छेद 20 का भाग नहीं।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• अनुच्छेद <b>20 और 21</b> राष्ट्रीय आपातकाल में भी निलंबित नहीं किए जा सकते (44वाँ संशोधन)।<br>• अनु. 20(1) – कार्योत्तर; 20(2) – दोहरा दंड; 20(3) – आत्म-अभिशंसन।<br>• <b>अनुच्छेद 22</b> – मनमानी गिरफ़्तारी और निरोध के विरुद्ध संरक्षण।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":45,"local_id":"50045","quid":"Q1000074825","section":"GK","topic":"Current Affairs: Appointments and Resignations","question":{"en":"Who is the current Secretary of the Department of Economic Affairs, Ministry of Finance (as of 2025)? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"वित्त मंत्रालय के आर्थिक कार्य विभाग के वर्तमान सचिव (2025 तक) कौन हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Shri Arunish Chawla","hi":"श्री अरुणीश चावला"},"2":{"en":"Shri Ajay Seth","hi":"श्री अजय सेठ"},"3":{"en":"Shri Arvind Shrivastava","hi":"श्री अरविंद श्रीवास्तव"},"4":{"en":"Shri V. Vualnam","hi":"श्री वी. वुअलनम"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – Shri Ajay Seth</b><br><b><u>Ajay Seth</u></b> served as <b>Secretary, Department of Economic Affairs (DEA)</b>, Ministry of Finance from 2021, and was also designated Finance Secretary in 2025.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• The Ministry of Finance has <b>six departments</b>, including Economic Affairs, Revenue, Expenditure, DIPAM, Financial Services and Public Enterprises.<br>• DEA prepares the <b>Union Budget</b> and the <b>Economic Survey</b>.<br>• The senior-most of the Secretaries is designated <b>Finance Secretary</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – श्री अजय सेठ</b><br><b><u>अजय सेठ</u></b> 2021 से वित्त मंत्रालय के <b>आर्थिक कार्य विभाग (DEA) के सचिव</b> रहे और 2025 में उन्हें वित्त सचिव भी नामित किया गया।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• वित्त मंत्रालय में आर्थिक कार्य, राजस्व, व्यय, DIPAM, वित्तीय सेवाएँ और लोक उद्यम सहित <b>छह विभाग</b> हैं।<br>• DEA <b>केंद्रीय बजट</b> और <b>आर्थिक सर्वेक्षण</b> तैयार करता है।<br>• सचिवों में वरिष्ठतम को <b>वित्त सचिव</b> नामित किया जाता है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":46,"local_id":"50046","quid":"Q1000074826","section":"GK","topic":"Current Affairs: Reports and Indices (Current)","question":{"en":"Approximately how many Indians live in regions less than 1 meter above sea level, as per The Lancet? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"द लैंसेट के अनुसार लगभग कितने भारतीय समुद्र तल से 1 मीटर से कम ऊँचाई वाले क्षेत्रों में रहते हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"4 million","hi":"40 लाख"},"2":{"en":"8 million","hi":"80 लाख"},"3":{"en":"12 million","hi":"1.2 करोड़"},"4":{"en":"18 million","hi":"1.8 करोड़"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (4) – 18 million</b><br>According to the <b>Lancet Countdown</b> report on health and climate change, about <b><u>18 million</u></b> people in India live in areas less than 1 metre above sea level, making them highly vulnerable to <b>sea-level rise</b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• India has a coastline of about <b>11,098 km</b> (revised in 2024).<br>• Vulnerable areas include <b>Sundarbans, Mumbai, Kolkata, Chennai</b> and low deltas.<br>• The IPCC projects global sea-level rise of up to about <b>1 m by 2100</b> under high emissions.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (4) – 1.8 करोड़</b><br>स्वास्थ्य और जलवायु परिवर्तन पर <b>लैंसेट काउंटडाउन</b> रिपोर्ट के अनुसार भारत में लगभग <b><u>1.8 करोड़</u></b> लोग समुद्र तल से 1 मीटर से कम ऊँचाई वाले क्षेत्रों में रहते हैं, जिससे वे <b>समुद्र-तल वृद्धि</b> के प्रति अत्यधिक संवेदनशील हैं।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• भारत की तटरेखा लगभग <b>11,098 km</b> है (2024 में संशोधित)।<br>• संवेदनशील क्षेत्रों में <b>सुंदरबन, मुंबई, कोलकाता, चेन्नई</b> और निचले डेल्टा शामिल हैं।<br>• IPCC ने उच्च उत्सर्जन पर <b>2100 तक लगभग 1 m</b> तक वैश्विक समुद्र-तल वृद्धि का अनुमान लगाया है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":47,"local_id":"50047","quid":"Q1000074827","section":"GK","topic":"Environment: Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"Which ecological goal is not a primary aim of the Aravalli Green Wall Initiative? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"अरावली ग्रीन वॉल पहल का प्राथमिक उद्देश्य कौन-सा पारिस्थितिक लक्ष्य नहीं है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Combat desertification","hi":"मरुस्थलीकरण से निपटना"},"2":{"en":"Sequester atmospheric carbon","hi":"वायुमंडलीय कार्बन का प्रच्छादन"},"3":{"en":"Enhance groundwater recharge","hi":"भूजल पुनर्भरण बढ़ाना"},"4":{"en":"Promote monoculture farming","hi":"एकल-फसल कृषि को बढ़ावा देना"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (4) – Promote monoculture farming</b><br>The <b>Aravalli Green Wall Project</b> aims to create a green belt along the Aravallis to <b>combat desertification</b>, increase carbon sink and recharge groundwater using native species. <b><u>Promoting monoculture farming</u></b> is not its aim.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Launched in <b>March 2023</b> by the <b>MoEFCC</b>; covers a 5 km buffer around the Aravallis.<br>• It spans <b>Gujarat, Rajasthan, Haryana and Delhi</b> (29 districts).<br>• Inspired by Africa's <b>Great Green Wall</b> (Sahel).","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (4) – एकल-फसल कृषि को बढ़ावा देना</b><br><b>अरावली ग्रीन वॉल परियोजना</b> का उद्देश्य देशज प्रजातियों से अरावली के साथ हरित पट्टी बनाकर <b>मरुस्थलीकरण से निपटना</b>, कार्बन सिंक बढ़ाना और भूजल पुनर्भरण करना है। <b><u>एकल-फसल कृषि को बढ़ावा देना</u></b> इसका उद्देश्य नहीं है।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>मार्च 2023</b> में <b>MoEFCC</b> द्वारा शुरू; अरावली के चारों ओर 5 km बफ़र क्षेत्र को शामिल करता है।<br>• यह <b>गुजरात, राजस्थान, हरियाणा और दिल्ली</b> (29 ज़िलों) में फैला है।<br>• यह अफ्रीका की <b>ग्रेट ग्रीन वॉल</b> (साहेल) से प्रेरित है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":48,"local_id":"50048","quid":"Q1000074828","section":"GK","topic":"Current Affairs: International News","question":{"en":"Which of the following correctly matches a Quad 2025 initiative with its sector? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"निम्नलिखित में से कौन-सा क्वाड 2025 पहल का उसके क्षेत्र से सही मिलान करता है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Cancer Moonshot – Maritime security","hi":"कैंसर मूनशॉट – समुद्री सुरक्षा"},"2":{"en":"MAITRI – Port construction","hi":"मैत्री – बंदरगाह निर्माण"},"3":{"en":"QUIN – Foreign policy doctrine","hi":"QUIN – विदेश नीति सिद्धांत"},"4":{"en":"Digital Public Infrastructure – Fintech interoperability","hi":"डिजिटल सार्वजनिक अवसंरचना – फिनटेक अंतर-संचालनीयता"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (4) – Digital Public Infrastructure – Fintech interoperability</b><br>The Quad's work on <b><u>Digital Public Infrastructure</u></b> focuses on <b>fintech and payment interoperability</b> in the Indo-Pacific. Cancer Moonshot is a health initiative and MAITRI is a maritime training initiative, so the other pairs are wrong.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• <b>MAITRI</b> – Maritime Initiative for Training in the Indo-Pacific, announced at the <b>Wilmington Summit (2024)</b>.<br>• <b>Quad Cancer Moonshot</b> targets cervical cancer in the Indo-Pacific.<br>• Quad members: <b>India, USA, Japan, Australia</b>; India is to host the next leaders' summit.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (4) – डिजिटल सार्वजनिक अवसंरचना – फिनटेक अंतर-संचालनीयता</b><br><b><u>डिजिटल सार्वजनिक अवसंरचना</u></b> पर क्वाड का कार्य हिंद-प्रशांत में <b>फिनटेक और भुगतान अंतर-संचालनीयता</b> पर केंद्रित है। कैंसर मूनशॉट स्वास्थ्य पहल और मैत्री समुद्री प्रशिक्षण पहल है, अतः अन्य युग्म गलत हैं।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• <b>मैत्री (MAITRI)</b> – हिंद-प्रशांत समुद्री प्रशिक्षण पहल, <b>विलमिंगटन शिखर सम्मेलन (2024)</b> में घोषित।<br>• <b>क्वाड कैंसर मूनशॉट</b> हिंद-प्रशांत में गर्भाशय-ग्रीवा कैंसर पर केंद्रित है।<br>• क्वाड सदस्य: <b>भारत, अमेरिका, जापान, ऑस्ट्रेलिया</b>; अगला नेता-स्तरीय शिखर सम्मेलन भारत में होना है।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":49,"local_id":"50049","quid":"Q1000074829","section":"GK","topic":"Static GK: Miscellaneous","question":{"en":"UNESCO has recognized which of the following as intangible cultural heritage from India? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यूनेस्को ने भारत से निम्नलिखित में से किसे अमूर्त सांस्कृतिक विरासत के रूप में मान्यता दी है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Bollywood film songs","hi":"बॉलीवुड फ़िल्मी गीत"},"2":{"en":"Baul songs and Vedic chanting","hi":"बाउल गीत और वैदिक मंत्रोच्चार"},"3":{"en":"Punjabi pop music","hi":"पंजाबी पॉप संगीत"},"4":{"en":"Ghazals by contemporary artists","hi":"समकालीन कलाकारों की ग़ज़लें"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (2) – Baul songs and Vedic chanting</b><br><b><u>Vedic chanting</u></b> (inscribed 2008) and <b><u>Baul songs</u></b> of Bengal (2008) are on UNESCO's list of the <b>Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity</b>.<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• Other Indian ICH elements: <b>Ramlila, Kutiyattam, Kumbh Mela, Yoga, Durga Puja in Kolkata, Garba of Gujarat</b>.<br>• India has <b>15+</b> elements on the list; Garba was added in <b>2023</b>.<br>• <b>Durga Puja in Kolkata</b> was inscribed in <b>2021</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (2) – बाउल गीत और वैदिक मंत्रोच्चार</b><br><b><u>वैदिक मंत्रोच्चार</u></b> (2008 में अंकित) और बंगाल के <b><u>बाउल गीत</u></b> (2008) यूनेस्को की <b>मानवता की अमूर्त सांस्कृतिक विरासत</b> सूची में हैं।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• अन्य भारतीय अमूर्त विरासत: <b>रामलीला, कुटियाट्टम, कुंभ मेला, योग, कोलकाता की दुर्गा पूजा, गुजरात का गरबा</b>।<br>• सूची में भारत के <b>15+</b> तत्व हैं; गरबा <b>2023</b> में जोड़ा गया।<br>• <b>कोलकाता की दुर्गा पूजा</b> को <b>2021</b> में अंकित किया गया।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":50,"local_id":"50050","quid":"Q1000074830","section":"GK","topic":"Medieval History: Vijayanagara and Bahmani Kingdom","question":{"en":"After the Bahmani Sultanate disintegrated, it split into how many successor states? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"बहमनी सल्तनत के विघटन के बाद यह कितने उत्तराधिकारी राज्यों में बँट गई? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Two","hi":"दो"},"2":{"en":"Three","hi":"तीन"},"3":{"en":"Five","hi":"पाँच"},"4":{"en":"Seven","hi":"सात"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Correct Answer: Option (3) – Five</b><br>The Bahmani Sultanate broke up into <b><u>five</u></b> Deccan Sultanates: <b>Bijapur</b> (Adil Shahi), <b>Golconda</b> (Qutb Shahi), <b>Ahmednagar</b> (Nizam Shahi), <b>Berar</b> (Imad Shahi) and <b>Bidar</b> (Barid Shahi).<br><br><br><b><u>Important Points:</u></b><br>• The Bahmani Sultanate was founded in <b>1347</b> by <b>Alauddin Hasan Bahman Shah</b>; capital Gulbarga, later Bidar.<br>• Its famous minister <b>Mahmud Gawan</b> built a madrasa at Bidar.<br>• The Deccan Sultanates defeated Vijayanagara at <b>Talikota (1565)</b>.","hi":"<b>सही उत्तर: विकल्प (3) – पाँच</b><br>बहमनी सल्तनत <b><u>पाँच</u></b> दक्कनी सल्तनतों में बँट गई: <b>बीजापुर</b> (आदिलशाही), <b>गोलकुंडा</b> (कुतुबशाही), <b>अहमदनगर</b> (निज़ामशाही), <b>बरार</b> (इमादशाही) और <b>बीदर</b> (बरीदशाही)।<br><br><br><b><u>महत्वपूर्ण बिंदु:</u></b><br>• बहमनी सल्तनत की स्थापना <b>1347</b> में <b>अलाउद्दीन हसन बहमन शाह</b> ने की; राजधानी गुलबर्गा, बाद में बीदर।<br>• इसके प्रसिद्ध मंत्री <b>महमूद गवाँ</b> ने बीदर में मदरसा बनवाया।<br>• दक्कनी सल्तनतों ने <b>तालीकोटा (1565)</b> में विजयनगर को हराया।"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false}]},"MATH":{"seconds":900,"questions":[{"no":51,"local_id":"50051","quid":"Q1000074831","section":"MATH","topic":"Time and Work","question":{"en":"The college IT cell is digitizing student records. Two computers, Comp A and Comp B, are assigned the task. Comp A processes the records in x hours, Comp B, being 25% faster, completes it in (x − 4) hours. Due to a malfunction, Comp A had to work alone for the first (x/2) hours, after which Comp B joined, and they completed the rest together in 4 hours.<br>If the square of x equals the mean of 36, 64, 100, and 144, find the value of x. (upto 4 decimal places). [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"कॉलेज का IT सेल छात्र अभिलेखों का डिजिटलीकरण कर रहा है। दो कंप्यूटर, Comp A और Comp B, को यह कार्य सौंपा गया है। Comp A अभिलेखों को x घंटे में संसाधित करता है, Comp B 25% अधिक तेज़ होने के कारण इसे (x − 4) घंटे में पूरा करता है। खराबी के कारण Comp A को पहले (x/2) घंटे अकेले काम करना पड़ा, उसके बाद Comp B जुड़ गया और उन्होंने शेष काम 4 घंटे में साथ पूरा किया।<br>यदि x का वर्ग 36, 64, 100 और 144 के माध्य के बराबर है, तो x का मान ज्ञात कीजिए। (4 दशमलव स्थानों तक) [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"9.2736"},"2":{"en":"8.3246"},"3":{"en":"9.7663"},"4":{"en":"9.3672"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Mean \\(= \\frac{36+64+100+144}{4} = 86\\)<br>\\(x^2 = 86 \\Rightarrow x = \\sqrt{86}\\)<br>\\(x = \\boxed{9.2736}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 9.2736.</b>","hi":"माध्य \\(= \\frac{36+64+100+144}{4} = 86\\)<br>\\(x^2 = 86 \\Rightarrow x = \\sqrt{86}\\)<br>\\(x = \\boxed{9.2736}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): 9.2736 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":52,"local_id":"50052","quid":"Q1000074832","section":"MATH","topic":"Mensuration (3D)","question":{"en":"A metal pipe is 77 cm long. The inner diameter of a cross-section is 4 cm, and the outer diameter is 4.4 cm. What is the total surface area of the pipe? (Use π = 22/7) [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक धातु का पाइप 77 cm लंबा है। अनुप्रस्थ काट का भीतरी व्यास 4 cm और बाहरी व्यास 4.4 cm है। पाइप का कुल पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल क्या है? (π = 22/7 लीजिए) [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2035 cm²"},"2":{"en":"2038 cm²"},"3":{"en":"2040 cm²"},"4":{"en":"2025 cm²"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"300\" height=\"142\" viewBox=\"-28 0 300 142\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M44 26L228 26M44 116L228 116\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"45\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"41\"/><ellipse cx=\"228\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"45\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"136\" y=\"132\">77 cm</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\">R = 2.2</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"end\">r = 2</text></g></svg><br>\\(r = 2\\), \\(R = 2.2\\), \\(h = 77\\)<br>Curved part \\(= 2\\pi h(R + r) = 2 \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 77 \\times 4.2 = 2032.8\\)<br>Two rings \\(= 2\\pi(R^2 - r^2) = 2 \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 0.84 = 5.28\\)<br>Total \\(\\approx \\boxed{2038\\ \\text{cm}^2}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 2038 cm².</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"300\" height=\"142\" viewBox=\"-28 0 300 142\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M44 26L228 26M44 116L228 116\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"45\"/><ellipse cx=\"44\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"41\"/><ellipse cx=\"228\" cy=\"71\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"45\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"136\" y=\"132\">77 cm</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"end\">R = 2.2</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"75\" text-anchor=\"end\">r = 2</text></g></svg><br>\\(r = 2\\), \\(R = 2.2\\), \\(h = 77\\)<br>वक्र भाग \\(= 2\\pi h(R + r) = 2 \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 77 \\times 4.2 = 2032.8\\)<br>दो वलय \\(= 2\\pi(R^2 - r^2) = 2 \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 0.84 = 5.28\\)<br>कुल \\(\\approx \\boxed{2038\\ \\text{cm}^2}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 2038 cm² है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":53,"local_id":"50053","quid":"Q1000074833","section":"MATH","topic":"Mensuration (3D)","question":{"en":"A regular square pyramid is cut by a plane parallel to its base. The cut is made at a height of 4 cm from the vertex. The original height of the pyramid was 10 cm. If the area of the base of the original pyramid (which is also the larger base of the frustum) is 100 cm², find the volume of the original pyramid. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक सम वर्गाकार पिरामिड को उसके आधार के समांतर समतल से काटा जाता है। यह कटाव शीर्ष से 4 cm की ऊँचाई पर किया गया है। मूल पिरामिड की ऊँचाई 10 cm थी। यदि मूल पिरामिड के आधार (जो छिन्नक का बड़ा आधार भी है) का क्षेत्रफल 100 cm² है, तो मूल पिरामिड का आयतन ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"266.67 cm³"},"2":{"en":"333.33 cm³"},"3":{"en":"400 cm³"},"4":{"en":"450 cm³"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"252\" height=\"207\" viewBox=\"0 0 252 207\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 181L159 181M26 181L126 26M159 181L226 138M159 181L126 26M226 138L126 26\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M226 138L93 138M93 138L26 181M93 138L126 26M126 26L126 159\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"159\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#000\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"122\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">10 cm</text><text x=\"93\" y=\"197\">10 cm</text></g></svg><br>Base area \\(= 100 \\Rightarrow\\) side \\(= 10\\), so base is \\(10 \\times 10\\)<br>Volume \\(= \\frac{1}{3} \\times 100 \\times 10\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{333.33\\ \\text{cm}^3}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 333.33 cm³.</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"252\" height=\"207\" viewBox=\"0 0 252 207\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 181L159 181M26 181L126 26M159 181L226 138M159 181L126 26M226 138L126 26\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M226 138L93 138M93 138L26 181M93 138L126 26M126 26L126 159\"/><circle cx=\"126\" cy=\"159\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#000\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"122\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\">10 cm</text><text x=\"93\" y=\"197\">10 cm</text></g></svg><br>आधार क्षेत्रफल \\(= 100 \\Rightarrow\\) भुजा \\(= 10\\), अतः आधार \\(10 \\times 10\\)<br>आयतन \\(= \\frac{1}{3} \\times 100 \\times 10\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{333.33\\ \\text{cm}^3}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 333.33 cm³ है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":54,"local_id":"50054","quid":"Q1000074834","section":"MATH","topic":"Mensuration (3D)","question":{"en":"A right prism has total surface area 1400 cm². Its base is a rectangle 20 cm × 15 cm. Find the height. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक लंब प्रिज़्म का कुल पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल 1400 cm² है। उसका आधार 20 cm × 15 cm का आयत है। ऊँचाई ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"21.52 cm"},"2":{"en":"11.42 cm"},"3":{"en":"19.79 cm"},"4":{"en":"17.67 cm"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"252\" height=\"170\" viewBox=\"0 0 252 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 144L171 144M26 144L26 61M171 144L226 109M171 144L171 61M26 61L171 61M26 61L81 26M226 109L226 26M171 61L226 26M81 26L226 26\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M26 144L81 109M81 109L226 109M81 109L81 26\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"99\" y=\"160\">20 cm</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"148\">15 cm</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\">h</text></g></svg><br>\\(2lb + 2h(l + b) = 1400\\)<br>\\(600 + 70h = 1400 \\Rightarrow h = \\frac{800}{70}\\)<br>\\(h = \\boxed{11.42\\ \\text{cm}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 11.42 cm.</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"252\" height=\"170\" viewBox=\"0 0 252 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 144L171 144M26 144L26 61M171 144L226 109M171 144L171 61M26 61L171 61M26 61L81 26M226 109L226 26M171 61L226 26M81 26L226 26\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M26 144L81 109M81 109L226 109M81 109L81 26\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"99\" y=\"160\">20 cm</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"148\">15 cm</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\">h</text></g></svg><br>\\(2lb + 2h(l + b) = 1400\\)<br>\\(600 + 70h = 1400 \\Rightarrow h = \\frac{800}{70}\\)<br>\\(h = \\boxed{11.42\\ \\text{cm}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 11.42 cm है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":55,"local_id":"50055","quid":"Q1000074835","section":"MATH","topic":"Height and Distance","question":{"en":"From a point on horizontal ground, located 129 meters away from the base of a cliff, the angle of elevation to the cliff's summit is observed to be 30°. Determine the vertical height of the cliff. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"क्षैतिज भूमि पर एक चट्टान के आधार से 129 मीटर दूर स्थित एक बिंदु से चट्टान के शिखर का उन्नयन कोण 30° देखा गया। चट्टान की ऊर्ध्वाधर ऊँचाई ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"50√3 m"},"2":{"en":"45√3 m"},"3":{"en":"43√3 m"},"4":{"en":"44√3 m"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"282\" height=\"185\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 185\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 159L256 159M26 159L26 26M34 159L34 151L26 151M256 159L26 26M238 159A18 18 0 0 1 240 150\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"14\" y=\"30\">A</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"170\">B</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"96\">h</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"11\">30°</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"173\">C</text><text x=\"141\" y=\"175\">129 m</text></g></svg><br>\\(\\tan 30° = \\frac{h}{129}\\)<br>\\(h = \\frac{129}{\\sqrt{3}} = 43\\sqrt{3}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{43\\sqrt{3}\\ \\text{m}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 43√3 m.</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"282\" height=\"185\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 185\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 159L256 159M26 159L26 26M34 159L34 151L26 151M256 159L26 26M238 159A18 18 0 0 1 240 150\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"14\" y=\"30\">A</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"170\">B</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"96\">h</text><text x=\"227\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"11\">30°</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"173\">C</text><text x=\"141\" y=\"175\">129 m</text></g></svg><br>\\(\\tan 30° = \\frac{h}{129}\\)<br>\\(h = \\frac{129}{\\sqrt{3}} = 43\\sqrt{3}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{43\\sqrt{3}\\ \\text{m}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 43√3 m है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":56,"local_id":"50056","quid":"Q1000074836","section":"MATH","topic":"Elementary Statistics","question":{"en":"Given below are the ages of 100 customers who visited a store in a day, answer the following questions based on this histogram.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q56.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>Calculate the percentage of customers aged between 28 and 47 years compared to the total number of customers. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"नीचे एक दिन में दुकान पर आए 100 ग्राहकों की आयु दी गई है, इस आयतचित्र के आधार पर निम्नलिखित प्रश्नों के उत्तर दीजिए।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q56.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>कुल ग्राहकों की तुलना में 28 से 47 वर्ष की आयु के ग्राहकों का प्रतिशत ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"52%"},"2":{"en":"60%"},"3":{"en":"65%"},"4":{"en":"70%"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Frequencies: 15, 25, 30, 20, 10, 5 (total 105 ≈ 100 in the chart)<br>Groups 28–37 and 38–47 \\(= 25 + 30 = 55\\)<br>\\(\\frac{55}{105} \\times 100 \\approx 52\\%\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{52\\%}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 52%.</b>","hi":"आवृत्तियाँ: 15, 25, 30, 20, 10, 5 (कुल 105 ≈ 100)<br>समूह 28–37 और 38–47 \\(= 25 + 30 = 55\\)<br>\\(\\frac{55}{105} \\times 100 \\approx 52\\%\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{52\\%}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): 52% है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q56.jpg"]}},{"no":57,"local_id":"50057","quid":"Q1000074837","section":"MATH","topic":"Elementary Statistics","question":{"en":"Given below the website page load times (in seconds) for a sample of 100 user visits, answer the following questions based on this histogram.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q57.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>What percentage of websites have a page load time between 0.6 and 1.5 seconds? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"100 उपयोगकर्ता विज़िट के नमूने के लिए वेबसाइट पेज लोड समय (सेकंड में) नीचे दिया गया है, इस आयतचित्र के आधार पर निम्नलिखित प्रश्नों के उत्तर दीजिए।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q57.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>कितने प्रतिशत वेबसाइटों का पेज लोड समय 0.6 से 1.5 सेकंड के बीच है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"45%"},"2":{"en":"58%"},"3":{"en":"55%"},"4":{"en":"60%"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Frequencies: 10, 30, 25, 15, 10, 5 (total 95)<br>Interval 0.6–1.5 covers two bars: \\(30 + 25 = 55\\)<br>\\(\\frac{55}{95} \\times 100 \\approx 58\\%\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{58\\%}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 58%.</b>","hi":"आवृत्तियाँ: 10, 30, 25, 15, 10, 5 (कुल 95)<br>अंतराल 0.6–1.5 में दो बार: \\(30 + 25 = 55\\)<br>\\(\\frac{55}{95} \\times 100 \\approx 58\\%\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{58\\%}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 58% है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q57.jpg"]}},{"no":58,"local_id":"50058","quid":"Q1000074838","section":"MATH","topic":"Algebra","question":{"en":"Factorise: a² + b² + 2ab. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"गुणनखंड कीजिए: a² + b² + 2ab। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"(a - b)²"},"2":{"en":"(a + b)²"},"3":{"en":"(a + b)(a - b)"},"4":{"en":"(a - b)(a + b)²"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"\\(a^2 + 2ab + b^2\\) is the standard identity<br>\\(= \\boxed{(a + b)^2}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): (a + b)².</b>","hi":"\\(a^2 + 2ab + b^2\\) एक मानक सर्वसमिका है<br>\\(= \\boxed{(a + b)^2}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): (a + b)² है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":59,"local_id":"50059","quid":"Q1000074839","section":"MATH","topic":"Coordinate Geometry","question":{"en":"The equation y = 2x + 3 represents a line.<br>What is the y-intercept? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"समीकरण y = 2x + 3 एक रेखा को दर्शाता है।<br>y-अंतःखंड क्या है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2"},"2":{"en":"5"},"3":{"en":"3"},"4":{"en":"6"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Compare with \\(y = mx + c\\)<br>Here \\(c = 3\\)<br>y-intercept \\(= \\boxed{3}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 3.</b>","hi":"\\(y = mx + c\\) से तुलना कीजिए<br>यहाँ \\(c = 3\\)<br>y-अंतःखंड \\(= \\boxed{3}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 3 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":60,"local_id":"50060","quid":"Q1000074840","section":"MATH","topic":"Compound Interest (CI)","question":{"en":"A sum of ₹1,00,000 is invested at compound interest at 12% per annum compounded quarterly.<br>What will be the amount after 1 year? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"₹1,00,000 की राशि 12% प्रतिवर्ष की दर से त्रैमासिक चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज पर निवेश की जाती है।<br>1 वर्ष बाद मिश्रधन क्या होगा? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"₹1,12,550.88"},"2":{"en":"₹1,12,360.45"},"3":{"en":"₹1,12,480"},"4":{"en":"₹1,12,640.25"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Rate per quarter \\(= 3\\%\\), \\(n = 4\\)<br>\\(A = 100000\\left(1.03\\right)^4 = 100000 \\times 1.12550881\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{1{,}12{,}550.88}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): ₹1,12,550.88.</b>","hi":"प्रति तिमाही दर \\(= 3\\%\\), \\(n = 4\\)<br>\\(A = 100000\\left(1.03\\right)^4 = 100000 \\times 1.12550881\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{1{,}12{,}550.88}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): ₹1,12,550.88 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":61,"local_id":"50061","quid":"Q1000074841","section":"MATH","topic":"Geometry","question":{"en":"A chord subtends an angle of 90° at the centre of a circle.<br>If the radius is 10 cm, find the chord length. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक जीवा वृत्त के केंद्र पर 90° का कोण बनाती है।<br>यदि त्रिज्या 10 cm है, तो जीवा की लंबाई ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"10√4 cm"},"2":{"en":"10√2 cm"},"3":{"en":"12√4 cm"},"4":{"en":"16 cm"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"222\" height=\"222\" viewBox=\"0 0 222 222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M51 171L111 111L171 171M51 171L171 171M100 122A16 16 0 0 0 122 122\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"111\" r=\"85\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"111\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#000\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"111\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"11\">90°</text><text x=\"111\" y=\"105\">O</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"185\">A</text><text x=\"182\" y=\"185\">B</text><text x=\"148\" y=\"138\">10</text></g></svg><br>Chord \\(= 2r\\sin\\left(\\frac{90°}{2}\\right) = 2 \\times 10 \\times \\sin 45°\\)<br>\\(= 20 \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{10\\sqrt{2}\\ \\text{cm}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 10√2 cm.</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"222\" height=\"222\" viewBox=\"0 0 222 222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M51 171L111 111L171 171M51 171L171 171M100 122A16 16 0 0 0 122 122\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"111\" r=\"85\"/><circle cx=\"111\" cy=\"111\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#000\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"111\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"11\">90°</text><text x=\"111\" y=\"105\">O</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"185\">A</text><text x=\"182\" y=\"185\">B</text><text x=\"148\" y=\"138\">10</text></g></svg><br>जीवा \\(= 2r\\sin\\left(\\frac{90°}{2}\\right) = 2 \\times 10 \\times \\sin 45°\\)<br>\\(= 20 \\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{10\\sqrt{2}\\ \\text{cm}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 10√2 cm है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":62,"local_id":"50062","quid":"Q1000074842","section":"MATH","topic":"Coordinate Geometry","question":{"en":"If the coordinates of the triangle vertices are A(2,3), B(8,3), and C(5,7), what are the coordinates of the centroid? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यदि त्रिभुज के शीर्षों के निर्देशांक A(2,3), B(8,3) और C(5,7) हैं, तो केंद्रक के निर्देशांक क्या हैं? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"(5,4)"},"2":{"en":"(5,13/3)"},"3":{"en":"(4,5)"},"4":{"en":"(5,5/3)"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Centroid \\(= \\left(\\frac{2+8+5}{3}, \\frac{3+3+7}{3}\\right)\\)<br>\\(= \\left(5, \\frac{13}{3}\\right)\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{\\left(5, \\frac{13}{3}\\right)}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): (5,13/3).</b>","hi":"केंद्रक \\(= \\left(\\frac{2+8+5}{3}, \\frac{3+3+7}{3}\\right)\\)<br>\\(= \\left(5, \\frac{13}{3}\\right)\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{\\left(5, \\frac{13}{3}\\right)}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): (5,13/3) है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":63,"local_id":"50063","quid":"Q1000074843","section":"MATH","topic":"Mensuration (3D)","question":{"en":"A regular square pyramid has a base side of 8 cm and a slant height of 10 cm.<br>Find its lateral surface area in square cm. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक सम वर्गाकार पिरामिड की आधार भुजा 8 cm और तिर्यक ऊँचाई 10 cm है।<br>उसका पार्श्व पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल (वर्ग cm में) ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"140"},"2":{"en":"170"},"3":{"en":"120"},"4":{"en":"160"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<svg width=\"247\" height=\"222\" viewBox=\"0 0 247 222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 196L156 196M26 196L124 26M156 196L221 154M156 196L124 26M221 154L124 26M130 175L130 169L124 169\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M221 154L91 154M91 154L26 196M91 154L124 26M124 26L189 175M124 175L189 175\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"162\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">l = 10 cm</text><text x=\"91\" y=\"212\">8 cm</text></g></svg><br>Lateral surface area \\(= 4 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times 8 \\times 10\\)<br>\\(= 4 \\times 40\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{160}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): 160.</b>","hi":"<svg width=\"247\" height=\"222\" viewBox=\"0 0 247 222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" font-size=\"12\"><path d=\"M26 196L156 196M26 196L124 26M156 196L221 154M156 196L124 26M221 154L124 26M130 175L130 169L124 169\"/><path stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" d=\"M221 154L91 154M91 154L26 196M91 154L124 26M124 26L189 175M124 175L189 175\"/><g fill=\"#000\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"162\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"11\">l = 10 cm</text><text x=\"91\" y=\"212\">8 cm</text></g></svg><br>पार्श्व पृष्ठीय क्षेत्रफल \\(= 4 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\times 8 \\times 10\\)<br>\\(= 4 \\times 40\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{160}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): 160 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":64,"local_id":"50064","quid":"Q1000074844","section":"MATH","topic":"Simplification and Approximation","question":{"en":"Which mixed fraction is equal to the decimal 4.25? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"कौन-सी मिश्रित भिन्न दशमलव 4.25 के बराबर है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"4(1/5)"},"2":{"en":"4(2/5)"},"3":{"en":"4(1/3)"},"4":{"en":"4(1/4)"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"\\(4.25 = 4 + 0.25\\)<br>\\(= 4 + \\frac{1}{4}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{4\\frac{1}{4}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): 4(1/4).</b>","hi":"\\(4.25 = 4 + 0.25\\)<br>\\(= 4 + \\frac{1}{4}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{4\\frac{1}{4}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): 4(1/4) है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":65,"local_id":"50065","quid":"Q1000074845","section":"MATH","topic":"Data Interpretation (DI)","question":{"en":"A bar diagram shows the number of tourists visiting 5 tourist spots during 4 months.<br>How many bars will the diagram contain? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक दंड आरेख 4 महीनों में 5 पर्यटन स्थलों पर आने वाले पर्यटकों की संख्या दर्शाता है।<br>आरेख में कितने दंड होंगे? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"15"},"2":{"en":"20"},"3":{"en":"9"},"4":{"en":"10"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"One bar for each spot in each month<br>\\(5 \\times 4 = \\boxed{20}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 20.</b>","hi":"प्रत्येक माह के प्रत्येक स्थल के लिए एक दंड<br>\\(5 \\times 4 = \\boxed{20}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 20 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":66,"local_id":"50066","quid":"Q1000074846","section":"MATH","topic":"Trigonometry","question":{"en":"If tanθ = 0, then sec²θ equals? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यदि tanθ = 0 है, तो sec²θ किसके बराबर है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"-1"},"2":{"en":"0"},"3":{"en":"2"},"4":{"en":"1"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"\\(\\sec^2\\theta = 1 + \\tan^2\\theta = 1 + 0\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{1}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): 1.</b>","hi":"\\(\\sec^2\\theta = 1 + \\tan^2\\theta = 1 + 0\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{1}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (4): 1 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":67,"local_id":"50067","quid":"Q1000074847","section":"MATH","topic":"Mensuration (2D)","question":{"en":"A square land in Gujarat is fenced at ₹140 per metre.<br>If the area of land is 8100 sq. m, what is the total fencing cost? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"गुजरात में एक वर्गाकार भूमि को ₹140 प्रति मीटर की दर से बाड़ से घेरा जाता है।<br>यदि भूमि का क्षेत्रफल 8100 वर्ग मीटर है, तो कुल बाड़ लगाने की लागत क्या है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"₹43,200"},"2":{"en":"₹44,400"},"3":{"en":"₹50,400"},"4":{"en":"₹46,000"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Side \\(= \\sqrt{8100} = 90\\) m<br>Perimeter \\(= 4 \\times 90 = 360\\) m<br>Cost \\(= 360 \\times 140 = \\boxed{50{,}400}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): ₹50,400.</b>","hi":"भुजा \\(= \\sqrt{8100} = 90\\) मीटर<br>परिमाप \\(= 4 \\times 90 = 360\\) मीटर<br>लागत \\(= 360 \\times 140 = \\boxed{50{,}400}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): ₹50,400 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":68,"local_id":"50068","quid":"Q1000074848","section":"MATH","topic":"Time Speed and Distance","question":{"en":"A car takes 4 hours to reach Ahmedabad from Surat at 60 km/h.<br>How long will it take to return at 80 km/h? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक कार सूरत से अहमदाबाद 60 km/h की गति से 4 घंटे में पहुँचती है।<br>80 km/h की गति से लौटने में कितना समय लगेगा? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2 hours","hi":"2 घंटे"},"2":{"en":"5 hours","hi":"5 घंटे"},"3":{"en":"3 hours","hi":"3 घंटे"},"4":{"en":"4 hours","hi":"4 घंटे"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Distance \\(= 60 \\times 4 = 240\\) km<br>Time \\(= \\frac{240}{80}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{3\\ \\text{hours}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 3 hours.</b>","hi":"दूरी \\(= 60 \\times 4 = 240\\) km<br>समय \\(= \\frac{240}{80}\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{3\\ \\text{घंटे}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 3 घंटे है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":69,"local_id":"50069","quid":"Q1000074849","section":"MATH","topic":"Trigonometry","question":{"en":"In a mechanical system designed to dampen vibrations, two rotating components operate at angles whose tangent values sum to 3 and multiply to 2. To determine the resulting vibration amplitude during phase overlap, the sine of the sum of these angles is required. If two angles have tangent values such that their sum is 3 and product is 2, find the sine of the sum of the two angles. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"कंपन को कम करने के लिए बनाए गए एक यांत्रिक तंत्र में, दो घूर्णनशील घटक ऐसे कोणों पर कार्य करते हैं जिनके स्पर्शज्या (tan) मानों का योग 3 और गुणनफल 2 है। फेज ओवरलैप के दौरान परिणामी कंपन आयाम ज्ञात करने के लिए इन कोणों के योग की ज्या (sine) आवश्यक है। यदि दो कोणों के tan मानों का योग 3 और गुणनफल 2 है, तो उन दोनों कोणों के योग की ज्या ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"0.9487"},"2":{"en":"(-0.9487)"},"3":{"en":"0.5"},"4":{"en":"(-0.5)"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"\\(\\tan(A+B) = \\frac{3}{1 - 2} = -3\\)<br>So \\(\\sin(A+B) = \\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\approx -0.9487\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{-0.9487}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): (-0.9487).</b>","hi":"\\(\\tan(A+B) = \\frac{3}{1 - 2} = -3\\)<br>अतः \\(\\sin(A+B) = \\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{10}} \\approx -0.9487\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{-0.9487}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): (-0.9487) है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":70,"local_id":"50070","quid":"Q1000074850","section":"MATH","topic":"Trigonometry","question":{"en":"In a virtual reality simulation, a character's movement follows a smooth arc defined by an angle θ relative to a reference axis. During one animation frame, developers notice that the sum of sine and cosine of the angle θ is equal to 1. To fine-tune motion rendering, the graphics engine estimates rotational energy using the sum of the cubes of sine and cosine of θ. What is the value of sin³θ + cos³θ, given that sinθ + cosθ = 1? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक वर्चुअल रियलिटी सिमुलेशन में, किसी पात्र की गति संदर्भ अक्ष के सापेक्ष कोण θ द्वारा परिभाषित एक चिकने चाप पर होती है। एक एनिमेशन फ्रेम के दौरान डेवलपर्स देखते हैं कि कोण θ की ज्या और कोज्या का योग 1 के बराबर है। मोशन रेंडरिंग को बेहतर बनाने के लिए ग्राफ़िक्स इंजन θ की ज्या और कोज्या के घनों के योग से घूर्णन ऊर्जा का अनुमान लगाता है। यदि sinθ + cosθ = 1 है, तो sin³θ + cos³θ का मान क्या है? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"0"},"2":{"en":"1"},"3":{"en":"-1"},"4":{"en":"2"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Let \\(s = \\sin\\theta\\), \\(c = \\cos\\theta\\) with \\(s + c = 1\\)<br>Squaring: \\(1 + 2sc = 1 \\Rightarrow sc = 0\\)<br>\\(s^3 + c^3 = (s + c)^3 - 3sc(s + c) = 1 - 0 = \\boxed{1}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 1.</b>","hi":"मान लीजिए \\(s = \\sin\\theta\\), \\(c = \\cos\\theta\\) तथा \\(s + c = 1\\)<br>वर्ग करने पर: \\(1 + 2sc = 1 \\Rightarrow sc = 0\\)<br>\\(s^3 + c^3 = (s + c)^3 - 3sc(s + c) = 1 - 0 = \\boxed{1}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 1 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":71,"local_id":"50071","quid":"Q1000074851","section":"MATH","topic":"Data Interpretation (DI)","question":{"en":"A publishing house analyzed how 720 editorial work-hours in a week were distributed across five departments involved in book production. The data was visualized in the form of a pie chart.<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q71.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>If the company merges Proofreading and Fact-checking into one department, what is their total fraction of the chart and angle? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"एक प्रकाशन गृह ने विश्लेषण किया कि एक सप्ताह के 720 संपादकीय कार्य-घंटे पुस्तक निर्माण से जुड़े पाँच विभागों में कैसे वितरित थे। डेटा को पाई चार्ट के रूप में दर्शाया गया।<br><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q71.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\"><br>यदि कंपनी प्रूफ़रीडिंग और फैक्ट-चेकिंग को मिलाकर एक विभाग बना दे, तो चार्ट में उनका कुल भाग और कोण क्या होगा? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"3/10 and 108°","hi":"3/10 और 108°"},"2":{"en":"5/12 and 115°","hi":"5/12 और 115°"},"3":{"en":"2/5 and 120°","hi":"2/5 और 120°"},"4":{"en":"3/8 and 135°","hi":"3/8 और 135°"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"Proofreading 18% + Fact-checking 12% \\(= 30\\%\\)<br>Fraction \\(= \\frac{30}{100} = \\frac{3}{10}\\); angle \\(= 0.30 \\times 360° = 108°\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{\\frac{3}{10}\\ \\text{and}\\ 108°}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 3/10 and 108°.</b>","hi":"प्रूफ़रीडिंग 18% + फैक्ट-चेकिंग 12% \\(= 30\\%\\)<br>भाग \\(= \\frac{30}{100} = \\frac{3}{10}\\); कोण \\(= 0.30 \\times 360° = 108°\\)<br>\\(\\boxed{\\frac{3}{10}\\ \\text{और}\\ 108°}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (1): 3/10 और 108° है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":true,"images":{"question":["https://res.cloudinary.com/mc6kb3uo/image/upload/ssc_mock/CGL-08-OCT-2026-SHIFT-3/q71.jpg"]}},{"no":72,"local_id":"50072","quid":"Q1000074852","section":"MATH","topic":"Mixture and Alligation","question":{"en":"Find the quantity of water added to 50 litres of a 20% alcohol solution to reduce alcohol concentration to 10%. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"20% अल्कोहल वाले 50 लीटर घोल में अल्कोहल की सांद्रता 10% करने के लिए कितना पानी मिलाना होगा? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"40L"},"2":{"en":"50L"},"3":{"en":"25L"},"4":{"en":"30L"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"Alcohol \\(= 20\\%\\) of 50 \\(= 10\\) L<br>\\(\\frac{10}{50 + x} = 0.10 \\Rightarrow 50 + x = 100\\)<br>\\(x = \\boxed{50\\ \\text{L}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 50L.</b>","hi":"अल्कोहल \\(= 50\\) का 20% \\(= 10\\) लीटर<br>\\(\\frac{10}{50 + x} = 0.10 \\Rightarrow 50 + x = 100\\)<br>\\(x = \\boxed{50\\ \\text{लीटर}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (2): 50L है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":73,"local_id":"50073","quid":"Q1000074853","section":"MATH","topic":"Time and Work","question":{"en":"Three workers A, B, and C can finish a task in 12, 15, and 20 days respectively. They all start together, A leaves after 3 days, and B leaves 2 days later. How many more days will C take to finish the work alone? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"तीन श्रमिक A, B और C एक कार्य को क्रमशः 12, 15 और 20 दिनों में पूरा कर सकते हैं। वे सभी साथ शुरू करते हैं, A 3 दिन बाद चला जाता है और B उसके 2 दिन बाद चला जाता है। शेष कार्य अकेले पूरा करने में C को और कितने दिन लगेंगे? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"6 days","hi":"6 दिन"},"2":{"en":"7 days","hi":"7 दिन"},"3":{"en":"3 days 8 hours","hi":"3 दिन 8 घंटे"},"4":{"en":"9 days","hi":"9 दिन"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Work \\(= 60\\) units; rates: A \\(= 5\\), B \\(= 4\\), C \\(= 3\\)<br>First 3 days \\(= 12 \\times 3 = 36\\); next 2 days (B + C) \\(= 7 \\times 2 = 14\\)<br>Remaining \\(= 60 - 50 = 10\\) units for C \\(= \\frac{10}{3}\\) days<br>\\(= \\boxed{3\\ \\text{days}\\ 8\\ \\text{hours}}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 3 days 8 hours.</b>","hi":"कार्य \\(= 60\\) इकाई; दरें: A \\(= 5\\), B \\(= 4\\), C \\(= 3\\)<br>पहले 3 दिन \\(= 12 \\times 3 = 36\\); अगले 2 दिन (B + C) \\(= 7 \\times 2 = 14\\)<br>शेष \\(= 60 - 50 = 10\\) इकाई C के लिए \\(= \\frac{10}{3}\\) दिन<br>\\(= \\boxed{3\\ \\text{दिन}\\ 8\\ \\text{घंटे}}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 3 दिन 8 घंटे है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":74,"local_id":"50074","quid":"Q1000074854","section":"MATH","topic":"Compound Interest (CI)","question":{"en":"Find CI on ₹10,000 for 1.5 years at 10% p.a., interest compounded half-yearly. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"₹10,000 पर 10% प्रतिवर्ष की दर से 1.5 वर्ष का चक्रवृद्धि ब्याज ज्ञात कीजिए, जब ब्याज अर्धवार्षिक रूप से संयोजित होता है। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"₹1547"},"2":{"en":"₹1552"},"3":{"en":"₹1576"},"4":{"en":"₹1585"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"Half-yearly rate \\(= 5\\%\\), \\(n = 3\\)<br>\\(A = 10000(1.05)^3 = 10000 \\times 1.157625 = 11576.25\\)<br>CI \\(= 11576.25 - 10000 = \\boxed{1576}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): ₹1576.</b>","hi":"अर्धवार्षिक दर \\(= 5\\%\\), \\(n = 3\\)<br>\\(A = 10000(1.05)^3 = 10000 \\times 1.157625 = 11576.25\\)<br>CI \\(= 11576.25 - 10000 = \\boxed{1576}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): ₹1576 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":75,"local_id":"50075","quid":"Q1000074855","section":"MATH","topic":"Algebra","question":{"en":"If x − 1/x = 2, find the value of x⁴ + 1/x⁴. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]","hi":"यदि x − 1/x = 2 है, तो x⁴ + 1/x⁴ का मान ज्ञात कीजिए। [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"18"},"2":{"en":"20"},"3":{"en":"34"},"4":{"en":"24"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"\\(x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} = 4 + 2 = 6\\)<br>\\(x^4 + \\frac{1}{x^4} = 6^2 - 2\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{34}\\)<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): 34.</b>","hi":"\\(x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} = 4 + 2 = 6\\)<br>\\(x^4 + \\frac{1}{x^4} = 6^2 - 2\\)<br>\\(= \\boxed{34}\\)<br><br><b>अतः सही उत्तर विकल्प (3): 34 है।</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false}]},"ENGLISH":{"seconds":900,"questions":[{"no":76,"local_id":"50076","quid":"Q1000074856","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Antonym","question":{"en":"Select the most appropriate antonym of the given word. <b>Obsolete</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Ancient"},"2":{"en":"Current"},"3":{"en":"Useless"},"4":{"en":"Outdated"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Obsolete (अप्रचलित) = no longer produced, used or useful.</b><br><b>Ancient (प्राचीन)</b> = belonging to the distant past<br><b>Current (वर्तमान)</b> = belonging to the present time ✔<br><b>Useless (बेकार)</b> = serving no purpose<br><b>Outdated (पुराना)</b> = old-fashioned<br>More antonyms: modern, contemporary, up-to-date.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): Current.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":77,"local_id":"50077","quid":"Q1000074857","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Antonym","question":{"en":"Select the most appropriate antonym of the given word. <b>Copious</b> [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Prolix"},"2":{"en":"Scarce"},"3":{"en":"Comprehensive"},"4":{"en":"Voluminous"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Copious (प्रचुर) = abundant in quantity or supply.</b><br><b>Prolix (शब्दाडंबरपूर्ण)</b> = using too many words<br><b>Scarce (दुर्लभ, अपर्याप्त)</b> = insufficient or rare ✔<br><b>Comprehensive (व्यापक)</b> = covering all aspects<br><b>Voluminous (विशाल)</b> = very large or extensive<br>More antonyms: meagre, sparse, scanty.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): Scarce.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":78,"local_id":"50078","quid":"Q1000074858","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Direct Indirect (Narration)","question":{"en":"Convert the below given indirect speech into direct speech appropriately:<br>He told me that he was going to the market. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"He told me, “I go to the market”."},"2":{"en":"He told me, “I had been going to the market”."},"3":{"en":"He told me, “I am going to the market”."},"4":{"en":"He told me, “I will be going to the market”."}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: Restore “he” to “I” and past continuous to present continuous.</b><br>“He was going” therefore becomes “I am going.”<br>A changes to simple present; B uses past perfect continuous.<br>D changes the reported action to future continuous.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): He told me, “I am going to the market”.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":79,"local_id":"50079","quid":"Q1000074859","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Sentence Improvement","question":{"en":"Identify the option that best corrects the highlighted part of the sentence for proper grammar and usage.<br>He is interested <b>for learning</b> new languages. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"for learn"},"2":{"en":"in learning"},"3":{"en":"to learning"},"4":{"en":"with learning"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: The adjective “interested” takes “in + gerund.”</b><br>Correct sentence: “He is interested <b>in learning</b> new languages.”<br>“For learn” and “to learning” use invalid forms after the preposition.<br>“With learning” does not form the standard adjective–preposition combination.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): in learning.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":80,"local_id":"50080","quid":"Q1000074860","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Sentence Improvement","question":{"en":"Identify the option that best corrects the highlighted part of the sentence for proper grammar and usage.<br>He congratulated me <b>for</b> my success. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"with my success"},"2":{"en":"by my success"},"3":{"en":"on my success"},"4":{"en":"of my success"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: “Congratulate somebody on something” is the fixed construction.</b><br>Correct sentence: “He congratulated me <b>on</b> my success.”<br>“With,” “by” and “of” do not follow “congratulated” in this pattern.<br>The preposition “on” introduces the achievement being celebrated.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): on my success.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":81,"local_id":"50081","quid":"Q1000074861","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Spotting Errors","question":{"en":"Spot the error in the following sentence and identify the INCORRECT part.<br>She prefers coffee than tea in the morning. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"prefers coffee"},"2":{"en":"than tea"},"3":{"en":"in the morning"},"4":{"en":"No error"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: “Prefer” takes “to,” not “than,” when comparing two nouns.</b><br>The error lies in “than tea.”<br>Correct sentence: “She prefers coffee <b>to</b> tea in the morning.”<br>The other parts are grammatically correct.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): than tea.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":82,"local_id":"50082","quid":"Q1000074862","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Spotting Errors","question":{"en":"Spot the error in the following sentence and identify the INCORRECT part.<br>She insisted me to attend the meeting at any cost. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"insisted me to"},"2":{"en":"attend the meeting"},"3":{"en":"at any cost"},"4":{"en":"No error"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: “Insist” takes “on + gerund” or a that-clause, not an object followed by an infinitive.</b><br>The erroneous part is “insisted me to.”<br>Correct sentence: “She <b>insisted on my attending</b> the meeting at any cost.”<br>One may also write “insisted that I attend.”<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): insisted me to.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":83,"local_id":"50083","quid":"Q1000074863","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"One Word Substitution","question":{"en":"Choose the one-word substitute for “an act of talking excessively or pointlessly; rambling.” [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Prolixity"},"2":{"en":"Taciturnity"},"3":{"en":"Reticence"},"4":{"en":"Brevity"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Prolixity (शब्दाडंबर) = excessive or tedious wordiness.</b><br><b>Taciturnity (अल्पभाषिता)</b> = habitual silence<br><b>Reticence (संकोच, अल्पभाषिता)</b> = reluctance to speak<br><b>Brevity (संक्षिप्तता)</b> = concise use of words<br>Thus, “prolixity” exactly matches excessive or pointless talk.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): Prolixity.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":84,"local_id":"50084","quid":"Q1000074864","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Idioms and Phrases","question":{"en":"Choose the correct meaning of idiom given below:<br>“Break out in hives” [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"To develop rashes from allergies"},"2":{"en":"To react angrily"},"3":{"en":"To become unconscious"},"4":{"en":"To recover from illness"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Break out in hives (एलर्जी से चकत्ते निकलना)</b><br>It means suddenly develop red, itchy welts on the skin, often because of an allergy.<br>Example: “She broke out in hives after eating peanuts.”<br>Anger, unconsciousness and recovery do not describe this skin reaction.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): To develop rashes from allergies.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":85,"local_id":"50085","quid":"Q1000074865","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Homophones and Homonyms","question":{"en":"Identify the correct homonym that best fits the context of the sentence:<br>The children were excited to see the ___ during their visit to the national park. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"dear"},"2":{"en":"deer"},"3":{"en":"dears"},"4":{"en":"dare"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Deer (हिरण) = a wild hoofed animal; dear (प्रिय) = loved or expensive.</b><br>An animal seen in a national park is a “deer.”<br>“Dear” is an adjective or term of endearment, “dears” is its plural noun use, and “dare” means a challenge.<br>Only “deer” fits the context.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): deer.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":86,"local_id":"50086","quid":"Q1000074866","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Spelling Check","question":{"en":"Choose the correct spelling of the word, which means a general agreement or collective opinion reached by a group of people. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"Consanus"},"2":{"en":"Consensous"},"3":{"en":"Consensus"},"4":{"en":"Consenus"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Consensus (सामूहिक सहमति) = general agreement.</b><br>The correct spelling is “consensus,” ending in “-sus.”<br><b>Consanus</b> omits “se”; <b>Consensous</b> wrongly ends in “-ous.”<br><b>Consenus</b> omits the second “s.”<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): Consensus.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":87,"local_id":"50087","quid":"Q1000074867","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Direct Indirect (Narration)","question":{"en":"A sentence is provided in direct speech. From the four given options, choose the one that most accurately conveys the sentence in its corresponding indirect speech.<br>“Were it not for her persistence, we would never have succeeded,” remarked the CEO. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"The CEO said if it weren't her persistence, they wouldn't have succeeded."},"2":{"en":"The CEO remarked that had it not been for her persistence, they would never have succeeded."},"3":{"en":"The CEO remarked they never would have succeeded if not for her persistence."},"4":{"en":"The CEO said had it not been her persistence, they wouldn't succeed."}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Rule: “Were it not for” becomes “had it not been for” in reported speech.</b><br>“We” changes to “they,” while “would never have succeeded” remains the hypothetical past result.<br>A omits the required preposition and tense pattern; C weakens the precise inversion but also changes the construction.<br>D changes the result to “wouldn’t succeed.”<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): The CEO remarked that had it not been for her persistence, they would never have succeeded.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":88,"local_id":"50088","quid":"Q1000074868","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful passage.<br>1. Garbage trucks collect waste from residential zones.<br>2. Waste is taken to a segregation unit.<br>3. Non-biodegradable items are sent for recycling.<br>4. Biodegradable waste is moved to compost pits. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2-1-3-4"},"2":{"en":"1-2-4-3"},"3":{"en":"1-3-2-4"},"4":{"en":"4-1-2-3"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: 1-2-4-3</b><br>Collection comes first, followed by transport to a segregation unit.<br>After segregation, biodegradable waste goes to compost pits.<br>Non-biodegradable items are then sent for recycling.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): 1-2-4-3.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":89,"local_id":"50089","quid":"Q1000074869","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful passage.<br>1. The blood sample is centrifuged to separate plasma.<br>2. It is collected from the vein using a sterile needle.<br>3. Plasma is extracted into a fresh container.<br>4. It is labeled and sent for testing. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"2-1-3-4"},"2":{"en":"1-2-3-4"},"3":{"en":"2-3-1-4"},"4":{"en":"3-2-1-4"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: 2-1-3-4</b><br>First the blood sample is collected from a vein.<br>It is then centrifuged, after which the separated plasma is extracted.<br>Finally, the sample is labelled and sent for testing.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): 2-1-3-4.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":90,"local_id":"50090","quid":"Q1000074870","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful sentence<br>P. following a joint recommendation from the audit and ethics committees<br>Q. the procurement policy<br>R. was suspended indefinitely<br>S. due to procedural inconsistencies and budgetary overreach [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"QRSP"},"2":{"en":"PQRS"},"3":{"en":"QPRS"},"4":{"en":"RQSP"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: QRSP</b><br>Q provides the subject “the procurement policy,” and R supplies the passive predicate.<br>S explains why the policy was suspended.<br>P ends with the authority behind the action: a joint committee recommendation.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): QRSP.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":91,"local_id":"50091","quid":"Q1000074871","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful sentence<br>P. amid global economic instability<br>Q. the central bank's monetary interventions<br>R. were cautiously adjusted<br>S. to manage inflation without stalling growth [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"QRSP"},"2":{"en":"QSPR"},"3":{"en":"QSRP"},"4":{"en":"RQSP"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: QRSP</b><br>Q supplies the subject, and R gives the passive verb “were cautiously adjusted.”<br>S states the purpose of the adjustment.<br>P provides the wider context: global economic instability.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): QRSP.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":92,"local_id":"50092","quid":"Q1000074872","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful sentence<br>P. than decolonial methods of inquiry<br>Q. is more extractive<br>R. the dominance of Eurocentric paradigms<br>S. in indigenous research contexts [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"RQSP"},"2":{"en":"QRSP"},"3":{"en":"RPQS"},"4":{"en":"QSRP"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: RQSP</b><br>R supplies the subject “the dominance of Eurocentric paradigms.”<br>Q gives the comparative predicate “is more extractive,” and S locates it in indigenous research contexts.<br>P completes the comparison with decolonial methods.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): RQSP.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":93,"local_id":"50093","quid":"Q1000074873","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Cloze Test","question":{"en":"In the passage below, certain words have been removed. Read the passage thoroughly and choose the most suitable option to complete each blank appropriately.<br><br>The judiciary, in a constitutional democracy, occupies a space that is both exalted and ambiguous. It is exalted because it claims to stand apart from the immediacies of electoral calculation; it is ambiguous because the boundary between interpretation and invention is often blurred. Judicial review, by its nature, is a (1)___ exercise — it does not merely apply the law, it reshapes the very terrain on which law stands. Yet, courts often cloak their transformative role in a language of restraint. They invoke the need to defer to legislative wisdom, even when that deference veers into (2)___. In such moments, constitutional morality becomes not a guide but a rhetorical artefact — cited, but rarely contested. The risk is not judicial activism, but judicial (3)___: the quiet sanctioning of inertia under the guise of neutrality. To remedy this, one must reframe legitimacy not as insulation from scrutiny, but as (4)___ within plural constitutional visions. Only then can jurisprudence become dialogic, rather than doctrinal — a space where dissent is not anomaly, but architecture. The Constitution, after all, is not a monolith but a palimpsest — layered, overwritten, and constantly in the process of (5)___.<br><br><br>What should come in the place of blank number 1? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"ceremonial"},"2":{"en":"pragmatic"},"3":{"en":"hermeneutic"},"4":{"en":"adversarial"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Hermeneutic (व्याख्या-संबंधी) = relating to interpretation.</b><br>Judicial review is interpretive because it applies and reshapes the meaning of law.<br><b>Ceremonial (अनुष्ठानिक)</b> = relating to ritual<br><b>Pragmatic (व्यावहारिक)</b> = practical; <b>adversarial (प्रतिवादी)</b> = involving opposition<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): hermeneutic.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":94,"local_id":"50094","quid":"Q1000074874","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Cloze Test","question":{"en":"In the passage below, certain words have been removed. Read the passage thoroughly and choose the most suitable option to complete each blank appropriately.<br><br>The judiciary, in a constitutional democracy, occupies a space that is both exalted and ambiguous. It is exalted because it claims to stand apart from the immediacies of electoral calculation; it is ambiguous because the boundary between interpretation and invention is often blurred. Judicial review, by its nature, is a (1)___ exercise — it does not merely apply the law, it reshapes the very terrain on which law stands. Yet, courts often cloak their transformative role in a language of restraint. They invoke the need to defer to legislative wisdom, even when that deference veers into (2)___. In such moments, constitutional morality becomes not a guide but a rhetorical artefact — cited, but rarely contested. The risk is not judicial activism, but judicial (3)___: the quiet sanctioning of inertia under the guise of neutrality. To remedy this, one must reframe legitimacy not as insulation from scrutiny, but as (4)___ within plural constitutional visions. Only then can jurisprudence become dialogic, rather than doctrinal — a space where dissent is not anomaly, but architecture. The Constitution, after all, is not a monolith but a palimpsest — layered, overwritten, and constantly in the process of (5)___.<br><br><br>What should come in the place of blank number 2? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"abdication"},"2":{"en":"submission"},"3":{"en":"reciprocity"},"4":{"en":"entitlement"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Abdication (त्याग) = giving up a duty or responsibility.</b><br>The passage says courts defer to the legislature even when “that deference veers into ___”, i.e. when restraint goes so far that the court gives up its own duty of review.<br>“Abdication” captures this failure of duty, and it matches the later idea of “the quiet sanctioning of inertia”.<br>Submission (समर्पण) = yielding to another’s authority; it describes obedience, not the loss of the court’s own role<br>Reciprocity (पारस्परिकता) = mutual exchange; entitlement (अधिकार) = a right to something<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): abdication.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":95,"local_id":"50095","quid":"Q1000074875","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Cloze Test","question":{"en":"In the passage below, certain words have been removed. Read the passage thoroughly and choose the most suitable option to complete each blank appropriately.<br><br>The judiciary, in a constitutional democracy, occupies a space that is both exalted and ambiguous. It is exalted because it claims to stand apart from the immediacies of electoral calculation; it is ambiguous because the boundary between interpretation and invention is often blurred. Judicial review, by its nature, is a (1)___ exercise — it does not merely apply the law, it reshapes the very terrain on which law stands. Yet, courts often cloak their transformative role in a language of restraint. They invoke the need to defer to legislative wisdom, even when that deference veers into (2)___. In such moments, constitutional morality becomes not a guide but a rhetorical artefact — cited, but rarely contested. The risk is not judicial activism, but judicial (3)___: the quiet sanctioning of inertia under the guise of neutrality. To remedy this, one must reframe legitimacy not as insulation from scrutiny, but as (4)___ within plural constitutional visions. Only then can jurisprudence become dialogic, rather than doctrinal — a space where dissent is not anomaly, but architecture. The Constitution, after all, is not a monolith but a palimpsest — layered, overwritten, and constantly in the process of (5)___.<br><br><br>What should come in the place of blank number 3? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"deference"},"2":{"en":"minimalism"},"3":{"en":"complicity"},"4":{"en":"adventurism"}},"answer":"3","solution":{"en":"<b>Complicity (सह-अपराधिता, सहभागिता) = involvement in wrongdoing.</b><br>By quietly sanctioning inertia under the appearance of neutrality, courts become complicit.<br><b>Deference (सम्मानपूर्ण आज्ञापालन)</b> = respectful yielding<br><b>Minimalism (न्यूनतमवाद)</b> = restraint; <b>adventurism (साहसिकतावाद)</b> = reckless action<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (3): complicity.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":96,"local_id":"50096","quid":"Q1000074876","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Cloze Test","question":{"en":"In the passage below, certain words have been removed. Read the passage thoroughly and choose the most suitable option to complete each blank appropriately.<br><br>The judiciary, in a constitutional democracy, occupies a space that is both exalted and ambiguous. It is exalted because it claims to stand apart from the immediacies of electoral calculation; it is ambiguous because the boundary between interpretation and invention is often blurred. Judicial review, by its nature, is a (1)___ exercise — it does not merely apply the law, it reshapes the very terrain on which law stands. Yet, courts often cloak their transformative role in a language of restraint. They invoke the need to defer to legislative wisdom, even when that deference veers into (2)___. In such moments, constitutional morality becomes not a guide but a rhetorical artefact — cited, but rarely contested. The risk is not judicial activism, but judicial (3)___: the quiet sanctioning of inertia under the guise of neutrality. To remedy this, one must reframe legitimacy not as insulation from scrutiny, but as (4)___ within plural constitutional visions. Only then can jurisprudence become dialogic, rather than doctrinal — a space where dissent is not anomaly, but architecture. The Constitution, after all, is not a monolith but a palimpsest — layered, overwritten, and constantly in the process of (5)___.<br><br><br>What should come in the place of blank number 4? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"anchoring"},"2":{"en":"immersion"},"3":{"en":"entrenchment"},"4":{"en":"accountability"}},"answer":"4","solution":{"en":"<b>Accountability (उत्तरदायित्व) = being answerable for decisions and actions.</b><br>It contrasts directly with “insulation from scrutiny” and supports plural constitutional dialogue.<br><b>Anchoring (स्थिरकरण)</b> = securing firmly<br><b>Immersion (निमग्नता)</b> = deep involvement; <b>entrenchment (सुदृढ़ीकरण)</b> = firm establishment<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (4): accountability.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":97,"local_id":"50097","quid":"Q1000074877","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Cloze Test","question":{"en":"In the passage below, certain words have been removed. Read the passage thoroughly and choose the most suitable option to complete each blank appropriately.<br><br>The judiciary, in a constitutional democracy, occupies a space that is both exalted and ambiguous. It is exalted because it claims to stand apart from the immediacies of electoral calculation; it is ambiguous because the boundary between interpretation and invention is often blurred. Judicial review, by its nature, is a (1)___ exercise — it does not merely apply the law, it reshapes the very terrain on which law stands. Yet, courts often cloak their transformative role in a language of restraint. They invoke the need to defer to legislative wisdom, even when that deference veers into (2)___. In such moments, constitutional morality becomes not a guide but a rhetorical artefact — cited, but rarely contested. The risk is not judicial activism, but judicial (3)___: the quiet sanctioning of inertia under the guise of neutrality. To remedy this, one must reframe legitimacy not as insulation from scrutiny, but as (4)___ within plural constitutional visions. Only then can jurisprudence become dialogic, rather than doctrinal — a space where dissent is not anomaly, but architecture. The Constitution, after all, is not a monolith but a palimpsest — layered, overwritten, and constantly in the process of (5)___.<br><br><br>What should come in the place of blank number 5? [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"ossification"},"2":{"en":"reconstitution"},"3":{"en":"adjudication"},"4":{"en":"derivation"}},"answer":"2","solution":{"en":"<b>Reconstitution (पुनर्गठन) = being formed or interpreted anew.</b><br>A palimpsest is repeatedly overwritten, so the Constitution is continually reconstituted.<br><b>Ossification (कठोर हो जाना)</b> = becoming rigid, the opposite idea.<br><b>Adjudication (निर्णयन)</b> = formal judgement; <b>derivation (व्युत्पत्ति)</b> = origin or formation from a source<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (2): reconstitution.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":98,"local_id":"50098","quid":"Q1000074878","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Para Jumbles (PQRS)","question":{"en":"Rearrange the following sentences in correct order to make a meaningful sentence<br>P. remains elusive<br>Q. in fragmented welfare systems<br>R. the ideal of universal access<br>S. to healthcare entitlements [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"RQSP"},"2":{"en":"RPQS"},"3":{"en":"QSRP"},"4":{"en":"RQPS"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Order: RQSP</b><br>R introduces the subject “the ideal of universal access.”<br>S completes “access to healthcare entitlements.”<br>Q places this ideal in fragmented welfare systems, and P supplies the predicate “remains elusive.”<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): RQSP.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":99,"local_id":"50099","quid":"Q1000074879","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Phrasal Verbs","question":{"en":"Read the sentence carefully and select the most suitable idiom/ phrase to fill in the blank.<br>My grandmother ___ Spanish while living in Spain for three years. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"picked up"},"2":{"en":"spend up"},"3":{"en":"leaning"},"4":{"en":"talking to"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Pick up (अपने आप सीख लेना) = acquire a skill or language informally.</b><br>Correct sentence: “My grandmother <b>picked up</b> Spanish while living in Spain for three years.”<br>“Spend up” is not a suitable phrasal verb; “leaning” and “talking to” do not express acquiring Spanish.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): picked up.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false},{"no":100,"local_id":"50100","quid":"Q1000074880","section":"ENGLISH","topic":"Fill in the Blanks","question":{"en":"Select the most appropriate option to fill in the blanks:<br>My introduction to the Y.M.C.A. swimming pool ___ unpleasant memories. [SSC CGL 08/10/26 Shift 3]"},"options":{"1":{"en":"revived"},"2":{"en":"rewind"},"3":{"en":"recognise"},"4":{"en":"repeat"}},"answer":"1","solution":{"en":"<b>Revived (पुनः जीवित किया) = brought memories or feelings back to consciousness.</b><br>The new experience brought unpleasant memories back, so “revived” fits.<br>“Rewind” is a verb for reversing a recording and is not correctly inflected here.<br>“Recognise” and “repeat” do not express the return of memories.<br><br><b>Hence, the correct answer is option (1): revived.</b>"},"marks":{"correct":2,"negative":0.5},"has_image":false}]}}};